window.IELTS_TOPIC={"topic":11,"en":"Food Production, Agriculture & Food Technology","zh":"糧食生產、農業與食品科技","items":[{"w":"arable","pos":"adj.","def":"suitable for growing crops","cn":"可耕種的","s":"Only a small part of Taiwan's land is ________ because most of the island is covered by mountains, so farmers must use every flat field carefully.","zh":"台灣只有一小部分土地是可耕種的，因為島上大部分被山脈覆蓋，所以農民必須小心利用每一塊平地。","part":"A","sec":"Crops & Farming 作物與耕作","lab":"A1","t":"可耕種的"},{"w":"wheat","pos":"n.","def":"a grain plant used to make flour and bread","cn":"小麥","s":"Most of the bread we eat is made from ________, but Taiwan imports almost all of it because the climate is too wet to grow it well.","zh":"我們吃的大部分麵包是用小麥做的，但台灣幾乎全部仰賴進口，因為氣候太潮濕而不容易種植。","part":"A","sec":"Crops & Farming 作物與耕作","lab":"A2","t":"小麥"},{"w":"rice paddy","pos":"n.","def":"a flooded field where rice is grown","cn":"稻田","s":"When we took the train through Yilan in spring, every ________ shone like a mirror, and my little brother kept taking photos of them.","zh":"春天我們搭火車經過宜蘭時，每一片稻田都像鏡子一樣閃閃發亮，我弟弟一直不停地拍照。","part":"A","sec":"Crops & Farming 作物與耕作","lab":"A3","t":"稻田"},{"w":"maize","pos":"n.","def":"a tall plant with yellow seeds; corn","cn":"玉米","s":"Much of the ________ grown in the United States is fed to animals, while only a small amount is eaten directly by people.","zh":"美國種植的大部分玉米被拿來餵動物，而只有一小部分是直接供人食用。","part":"A","sec":"Crops & Farming 作物與耕作","lab":"A4","t":"玉米"},{"w":"barley","pos":"n.","def":"a grain used for food, animal feed and making drinks","cn":"大麥","s":"My grandmother often makes a warm ________ tea in winter because she believes it is good for digestion, and the whole kitchen smells wonderful.","zh":"我奶奶冬天常煮熱熱的大麥茶，因為她相信這對消化有好處，而且整個廚房都很香。","part":"A","sec":"Crops & Farming 作物與耕作","lab":"A5","t":"大麥"},{"w":"soybean","pos":"n.","def":"a bean used to make tofu, soy milk and oil","cn":"黃豆；大豆","s":"Tofu and soy milk both come from the ________, so it is an important source of protein for many vegetarians in Asia.","zh":"豆腐和豆漿都來自黃豆，所以它是亞洲許多素食者重要的蛋白質來源。","part":"A","sec":"Crops & Farming 作物與耕作","lab":"A6","t":"黃豆"},{"w":"cash crop","pos":"n.","def":"a crop grown to sell rather than to eat at home","cn":"經濟作物","s":"Coffee is a popular ________ in the mountains of Yunlin, and many young farmers have returned home because it brings a good income.","zh":"咖啡是雲林山區很受歡迎的經濟作物，而且許多年輕農民因為它能帶來不錯的收入而返鄉。","part":"A","sec":"Crops & Farming 作物與耕作","lab":"A7","t":"經濟作物"},{"w":"crop rotation","pos":"n.","def":"growing different crops in a field in different years","cn":"輪作","s":"The farmer uses ________ every year, so he plants beans after corn because the beans put goodness back into the soil.","zh":"這位農夫每年都採用輪作，所以他在玉米之後種豆類，因為豆類能讓土壤恢復養分。","part":"A","sec":"Crops & Farming 作物與耕作","lab":"A8","t":"輪作"},{"w":"monoculture","pos":"n.","def":"growing only one type of crop over a large area","cn":"單一作物栽培","s":"Huge areas of ________ look neat from the air, but one disease can destroy the whole farm because every plant is the same.","zh":"大面積的單一作物栽培從空中看起來很整齊，但一種病害就能摧毀整片農場，因為每株植物都一樣。","part":"A","sec":"Crops & Farming 作物與耕作","lab":"A9","t":"單一作物栽培"},{"w":"orchard","pos":"n.","def":"a piece of land where fruit trees are grown","cn":"果園","s":"We visited a strawberry farm and an apple ________ in Taichung, and the owner let us pick and eat fruit straight from the trees.","zh":"我們參觀了台中的草莓園和蘋果果園，而且園主讓我們直接從樹上摘水果來吃。","part":"A","sec":"Crops & Farming 作物與耕作","lab":"A10","t":"果園"},{"w":"vineyard","pos":"n.","def":"a farm where grapes are grown","cn":"葡萄園","s":"The family has run the ________ for three generations, and they still pick the grapes by hand because machines might damage them.","zh":"這個家族經營這座葡萄園已經三代了，而且他們仍然用手摘葡萄，因為機器可能會損傷葡萄。","part":"A","sec":"Crops & Farming 作物與耕作","lab":"A11","t":"葡萄園"},{"w":"greenhouse","pos":"n.","def":"a glass building where plants are grown in warm conditions","cn":"溫室","s":"Tomatoes grow well in the ________ even in winter, because the glass keeps the heat in and protects the plants from heavy rain.","zh":"即使在冬天，番茄在溫室裡也長得很好，因為玻璃能保住熱度並保護植物不受大雨侵襲。","part":"A","sec":"Crops & Farming 作物與耕作","lab":"A12","t":"溫室"},{"w":"seedling","pos":"n.","def":"a very young plant grown from a seed","cn":"幼苗","s":"We planted each ________ in a small pot on the balcony, and after three weeks they were strong enough to move into the garden.","zh":"我們把每一株幼苗種在陽台的小盆子裡，三個星期後它們就長得夠壯，可以移植到花園了。","part":"A","sec":"Crops & Farming 作物與耕作","lab":"A13","t":"幼苗"},{"w":"germinate","pos":"v.","def":"(of a seed) to start to grow","cn":"發芽","s":"The beans will ________ in about five days if you keep the cotton wet, but they will fail if the room is too cold.","zh":"如果你讓棉花保持濕潤，豆子大約五天就會發芽，但如果房間太冷，它們就長不出來。","part":"A","sec":"Crops & Farming 作物與耕作","lab":"A14","t":"發芽"},{"w":"ripen","pos":"v.","def":"to become ready to eat","cn":"成熟","s":"Bananas ________ faster in a paper bag, so my mother puts the green ones in a bag and waits a couple of days.","zh":"香蕉放在紙袋裡會更快成熟，所以我媽媽把綠色的香蕉放進袋子裡，再等個兩三天。","part":"A","sec":"Crops & Farming 作物與耕作","lab":"A15","t":"成熟"},{"w":"weed","pos":"n.","def":"a wild plant growing where it is not wanted","cn":"雜草","s":"Every Saturday my grandfather pulls out the ________ in his vegetable garden, because they steal water and sunlight from his cabbages.","zh":"每個星期六我爺爺都會拔掉菜園裡的雜草，因為它們會搶走高麗菜的水分和陽光。","part":"A","sec":"Crops & Farming 作物與耕作","lab":"A16","t":"雜草"},{"w":"insecticide","pos":"n.","def":"a chemical used to kill insects","cn":"殺蟲劑","s":"The farmer stopped spraying ________ on his fruit trees, and he now uses natural methods because he wants to protect the bees.","zh":"這位農夫不再對果樹噴灑殺蟲劑，現在改用天然的方法，因為他想保護蜜蜂。","part":"A","sec":"Crops & Farming 作物與耕作","lab":"A17","t":"殺蟲劑"},{"w":"herbicide","pos":"n.","def":"a chemical used to kill unwanted plants","cn":"除草劑","s":"Some farmers spray ________ to kill weeds quickly, but scientists worry that the chemicals can enter rivers and harm fish.","zh":"有些農民噴灑除草劑來快速除草，但科學家擔心這些化學物質會流入河川並傷害魚類。","part":"A","sec":"Crops & Farming 作物與耕作","lab":"A18","t":"除草劑"},{"w":"pollination","pos":"n.","def":"moving pollen between flowers so that fruit can grow","cn":"授粉","s":"Bees are essential for the ________ of many fruit trees, so farmers often rent hives when their orchards are in flower.","zh":"蜜蜂對許多果樹的授粉至關重要，所以農民常在果園開花時租用蜂箱。","part":"A","sec":"Crops & Farming 作物與耕作","lab":"A19","t":"授粉"},{"w":"bumper crop","pos":"n.","def":"an unusually large harvest","cn":"大豐收","s":"The weather was perfect this year, and the farmers enjoyed a ________ of mangoes, but prices fell because there was so much fruit.","zh":"今年天氣非常好，農民的芒果迎來大豐收，但因為水果太多，價格反而下跌了。","part":"A","sec":"Crops & Farming 作物與耕作","lab":"A20","t":"大豐收"},{"w":"plantation","pos":"n.","def":"a large farm growing one crop such as tea or rubber","cn":"大型農園；種植園","s":"We visited a tea ________ in Nantou, and the workers showed us how they pick only the youngest leaves by hand.","zh":"我們參觀了南投的一座茶葉種植園，而且工人示範他們如何只用手摘下最嫩的葉子。","part":"A","sec":"Crops & Farming 作物與耕作","lab":"A21","t":"種植園"},{"w":"smallholder","pos":"n.","def":"a farmer who owns or rents a small piece of land","cn":"小農","s":"Most rice in Taiwan is grown by a ________ with only a few fields, so these farmers often work together to buy machines.","zh":"台灣大部分的稻米是由只有幾塊田的小農種植的，所以這些農民常合作購買機器。","part":"A","sec":"Crops & Farming 作物與耕作","lab":"A22","t":"小農"},{"w":"agronomist","pos":"n.","def":"a scientist who studies soil and crops","cn":"農藝學家","s":"An ________ visited the village to test the soil, and she advised the farmers to plant beans because the land lacked nitrogen.","zh":"一位農藝學家來到村裡檢測土壤，她建議農民種豆類，因為土地缺乏氮。","part":"A","sec":"Crops & Farming 作物與耕作","lab":"A23","t":"農藝學家"},{"w":"horticulture","pos":"n.","def":"the study and practice of growing fruit, vegetables and flowers","cn":"園藝學","s":"My cousin is studying ________ at university, and she hopes to open a flower farm because she loves working with plants.","zh":"我表姊在大學攻讀園藝學，她希望開一間花卉農場，因為她很喜歡和植物一起工作。","part":"A","sec":"Crops & Farming 作物與耕作","lab":"A24","t":"園藝學"},{"w":"fallow","pos":"adj.","def":"(of land) left without crops for a period to recover","cn":"休耕的","s":"The farmer leaves one field ________ every few years, because the soil needs time to rest and recover its strength.","zh":"這位農夫每隔幾年就讓一塊田休耕，因為土壤需要時間休息並恢復地力。","part":"A","sec":"Crops & Farming 作物與耕作","lab":"A25","t":"休耕"},{"w":"till","pos":"v.","def":"to prepare and turn over soil for growing crops","cn":"耕（地）","s":"In the past, farmers used water buffalo to ________ the fields, but today most of them use small machines because they are faster.","zh":"過去農民用水牛來耕田，但現在大多數人使用小型機器，因為速度比較快。","part":"A","sec":"Crops & Farming 作物與耕作","lab":"A26","t":"耕"},{"w":"sugar cane","pos":"n.","def":"a tall plant whose stems are used to make sugar","cn":"甘蔗","s":"Southern Taiwan once had many fields of ________, and old sugar factories in Kaohsiung and Tainan have now become popular museums.","zh":"南台灣過去有許多甘蔗田，而高雄和台南的老糖廠如今已成為熱門的博物館。","part":"A","sec":"Crops & Farming 作物與耕作","lab":"A27","t":"甘蔗"},{"w":"scarecrow","pos":"n.","def":"a figure dressed in old clothes to frighten birds away from crops","cn":"稻草人","s":"The children made a funny ________ for the school garden, but the clever birds soon realised it was not a real person.","zh":"孩子們為學校菜園做了一個好笑的稻草人，但聰明的鳥兒很快就發現它不是真人。","part":"A","sec":"Crops & Farming 作物與耕作","lab":"A28","t":"稻草人"},{"w":"reap","pos":"v.","def":"to cut and collect a crop","cn":"收割","s":"The villagers work together to ________ the rice in autumn, and afterwards they share a big meal to celebrate the end of the season.","zh":"村民在秋天一起收割稻子，之後他們會共享一頓大餐來慶祝這一季的結束。","part":"A","sec":"Crops & Farming 作物與耕作","lab":"A29","t":"收割"},{"w":"soil","pos":"n.","def":"the top layer of earth in which plants grow","cn":"土壤","s":"Healthy ________ is full of tiny living things, and it can hold water much better than dry dust after a long drought.","zh":"健康的土壤充滿微小的生物，而且在長期乾旱後，它比乾燥的塵土更能保住水分。","part":"A","sec":"Soil, Water & Farm Equipment 土壤、水與農具","lab":"A30","t":"土壤"},{"w":"nutrient","pos":"n.","def":"a substance that helps plants, animals or people grow","cn":"養分；營養素","s":"Plants take in each ________ they need through their roots, so farmers test the soil to see what is missing.","zh":"植物透過根部吸收所需的每一種養分，所以農民會檢測土壤，看看缺少了什麼。","part":"A","sec":"Soil, Water & Farm Equipment 土壤、水與農具","lab":"A31","t":"養分"},{"w":"nitrogen","pos":"n.","def":"a gas that plants need to grow green leaves","cn":"氮","s":"Beans can add ________ to the soil, so organic farmers plant them between other crops instead of buying chemical fertilisers.","zh":"豆類能為土壤增加氮，所以有機農民把它們種在其他作物之間，而不是購買化學肥料。","part":"A","sec":"Soil, Water & Farm Equipment 土壤、水與農具","lab":"A32","t":"氮"},{"w":"manure","pos":"n.","def":"animal waste put on land to help crops grow","cn":"糞肥","s":"The farm smelled terrible after the workers spread ________ on the fields, but the vegetables grew very well later that year.","zh":"工人在田裡撒了糞肥之後農場臭氣沖天，但那年稍晚蔬菜長得非常好。","part":"A","sec":"Soil, Water & Farm Equipment 土壤、水與農具","lab":"A33","t":"糞肥"},{"w":"mulch","pos":"n.","def":"material like leaves or straw spread over soil to keep it moist","cn":"覆蓋物（護根）","s":"We put a thick layer of ________ around the young trees, so the soil stays damp and weeds cannot grow easily.","zh":"我們在小樹周圍鋪了一層厚厚的覆蓋物，所以土壤能保持濕潤，雜草也不容易生長。","part":"A","sec":"Soil, Water & Farm Equipment 土壤、水與農具","lab":"A34","t":"覆蓋物"},{"w":"soil degradation","pos":"n.","def":"the loss of soil quality and health","cn":"土壤劣化","s":"Too many chemicals and heavy machines can cause ________, and farmers then need even more fertiliser to grow the same amount of food.","zh":"過多的化學物質和重型機具會造成土壤劣化，於是農民需要更多肥料才能種出同樣多的糧食。","part":"A","sec":"Soil, Water & Farm Equipment 土壤、水與農具","lab":"A35","t":"土壤劣化"},{"w":"salinisation","pos":"n.","def":"the process of soil becoming too salty","cn":"鹽化","s":"Near the coast, seawater has caused the ________ of many fields, so rice no longer grows there and some farmers have left.","zh":"在沿海地區，海水造成許多農田鹽化，所以那裡不再能種稻，有些農民也已經離開。","part":"A","sec":"Soil, Water & Farm Equipment 土壤、水與農具","lab":"A36","t":"鹽化"},{"w":"sprinkler","pos":"n.","def":"a device that sprays water over plants or grass","cn":"灑水器","s":"The ________ turns on automatically at six every morning, so the vegetables get water before the sun becomes too hot.","zh":"灑水器每天早上六點會自動開啟，所以蔬菜能在太陽變得太熱之前得到水分。","part":"A","sec":"Soil, Water & Farm Equipment 土壤、水與農具","lab":"A37","t":"灑水器"},{"w":"drip irrigation","pos":"n.","def":"watering plants slowly through small tubes near their roots","cn":"滴灌","s":"Farmers in dry areas often use ________ because it sends water straight to the roots, and very little is lost to the sun.","zh":"乾燥地區的農民常使用滴灌，因為它把水直接送到根部，而且很少因日曬而流失。","part":"A","sec":"Soil, Water & Farm Equipment 土壤、水與農具","lab":"A38","t":"滴灌"},{"w":"groundwater","pos":"n.","def":"water held under the ground in soil or rocks","cn":"地下水","s":"Some fish farmers pump too much ________, and as a result the land in parts of Pingtung has slowly sunk.","zh":"有些養殖業者抽取過多地下水，結果屏東部分地區的地面慢慢下陷了。","part":"A","sec":"Soil, Water & Farm Equipment 土壤、水與農具","lab":"A39","t":"地下水"},{"w":"aquifer","pos":"n.","def":"a layer of rock under the ground that holds water","cn":"含水層","s":"The town gets its drinking water from a deep ________, but scientists warn that it will run dry if farms keep using so much.","zh":"這個小鎮的飲用水來自一個很深的含水層，但科學家警告，如果農場繼續大量用水，它就會枯竭。","part":"A","sec":"Soil, Water & Farm Equipment 土壤、水與農具","lab":"A40","t":"含水層"},{"w":"water table","pos":"n.","def":"the level below which the ground is full of water","cn":"地下水位","s":"The ________ has dropped by several metres in recent years, so farmers must dig deeper wells to reach water.","zh":"近年來地下水位已下降了好幾公尺，所以農民必須挖更深的井才能取到水。","part":"A","sec":"Soil, Water & Farm Equipment 土壤、水與農具","lab":"A41","t":"地下水位"},{"w":"tractor","pos":"n.","def":"a strong farm vehicle used to pull machines","cn":"拖拉機；耕耘機","s":"My uncle drives a small ________ to prepare his fields, and he lets the children ride on it when they visit the farm.","zh":"我叔叔開一台小型耕耘機來整地，而且孩子們到農場玩時他會讓他們坐上去。","part":"A","sec":"Soil, Water & Farm Equipment 土壤、水與農具","lab":"A42","t":"耕耘機"},{"w":"combine harvester","pos":"n.","def":"a large machine that cuts and cleans grain in one go","cn":"聯合收割機","s":"A single ________ can do the work of dozens of people, so a rice field that once took a week is now finished in an afternoon.","zh":"一台聯合收割機能完成好幾十個人的工作，所以以前要花一週的稻田，現在一個下午就收割完了。","part":"A","sec":"Soil, Water & Farm Equipment 土壤、水與農具","lab":"A43","t":"聯合收割機"},{"w":"seed drill","pos":"n.","def":"a machine that plants seeds in neat rows","cn":"播種機","s":"The farmer bought a new ________ last spring, and now his seeds are planted at exactly the right depth in straight lines.","zh":"這位農夫去年春天買了一台新的播種機，現在他的種子都能以剛好的深度種成整齊的直線。","part":"A","sec":"Soil, Water & Farm Equipment 土壤、水與農具","lab":"A44","t":"播種機"},{"w":"hoe","pos":"n.","def":"a garden tool with a long handle used to break up soil","cn":"鋤頭","s":"My grandmother still uses an old ________ in her garden, and she says it is better exercise than going to the gym.","zh":"我奶奶仍然在菜園裡用一把舊鋤頭，而且她說這比去健身房還要好的運動。","part":"A","sec":"Soil, Water & Farm Equipment 土壤、水與農具","lab":"A45","t":"鋤頭"},{"w":"rake","pos":"n.","def":"a tool with a row of teeth used to gather leaves or smooth soil","cn":"耙子","s":"After the leaves fell in autumn, we used a ________ to collect them, and then we added them to the compost pile.","zh":"秋天落葉之後，我們用耙子把它們集中起來，然後加進堆肥堆裡。","part":"A","sec":"Soil, Water & Farm Equipment 土壤、水與農具","lab":"A46","t":"耙子"},{"w":"sickle","pos":"n.","def":"a curved blade with a short handle used for cutting crops","cn":"鐮刀","s":"Before machines arrived, villagers cut rice with a ________, and the work was so tiring that their backs ached for days.","zh":"在機器出現之前，村民用鐮刀割稻，而且工作累到他們的背痛了好幾天。","part":"A","sec":"Soil, Water & Farm Equipment 土壤、水與農具","lab":"A47","t":"鐮刀"},{"w":"silo","pos":"n.","def":"a tall tower used for storing grain or animal food","cn":"筒倉；穀倉塔","s":"The grain is kept in a huge ________ next to the farm, because it stays dry there and rats cannot get inside.","zh":"穀物存放在農場旁邊一座巨大的筒倉裡，因為那裡能保持乾燥，老鼠也進不去。","part":"A","sec":"Soil, Water & Farm Equipment 土壤、水與農具","lab":"A48","t":"筒倉"},{"w":"barn","pos":"n.","def":"a large farm building for animals, crops or machines","cn":"穀倉；畜舍","s":"The cows sleep in the ________ during typhoons, and the farmer checks on them every few hours to make sure they are safe.","zh":"颱風期間乳牛睡在畜舍裡，而且農夫每隔幾小時就去查看，確保牠們安全。","part":"A","sec":"Soil, Water & Farm Equipment 土壤、水與農具","lab":"A49","t":"畜舍"},{"w":"granary","pos":"n.","def":"a building for storing grain","cn":"糧倉","s":"In ancient times, every village had a ________ for storing rice, so people would not starve if the next harvest failed.","zh":"在古代，每個村莊都有一座糧倉來儲存稻米，所以即使下一次收成失敗，人們也不會挨餓。","part":"A","sec":"Soil, Water & Farm Equipment 土壤、水與農具","lab":"A50","t":"糧倉"},{"w":"furrow","pos":"n.","def":"a long narrow line cut into soil for planting seeds","cn":"犁溝；田溝","s":"The children dropped one seed into each ________, and then they gently covered them with soil and gave them some water.","zh":"孩子們在每一條田溝裡放一顆種子，然後輕輕蓋上泥土並澆一些水。","part":"A","sec":"Soil, Water & Farm Equipment 土壤、水與農具","lab":"A51","t":"田溝"},{"w":"ditch","pos":"n.","def":"a long narrow channel dug to carry water away","cn":"水溝；溝渠","s":"The farmer dug a ________ along the edge of the field, so the heavy summer rain could drain away instead of flooding the crops.","zh":"農夫沿著田邊挖了一條溝渠，所以夏天的大雨可以排掉，而不會淹沒作物。","part":"A","sec":"Soil, Water & Farm Equipment 土壤、水與農具","lab":"A52","t":"溝渠"},{"w":"hose","pos":"n.","def":"a long rubber tube used to carry water","cn":"水管","s":"I watered the vegetables with a ________ this morning, but I forgot to turn it off, so the garden turned into a small lake.","zh":"我今天早上用水管給蔬菜澆水，但我忘了關掉，所以菜園變成了一個小湖。","part":"A","sec":"Soil, Water & Farm Equipment 土壤、水與農具","lab":"A53","t":"水管"},{"w":"polytunnel","pos":"n.","def":"a long plastic-covered tunnel for growing plants","cn":"塑膠布棚（隧道式溫室）","s":"Many strawberry farms in Miaoli use a ________ to protect the fruit from rain, so visitors can still pick berries on wet days.","zh":"苗栗許多草莓園使用塑膠布棚來保護果實不被雨淋，所以遊客即使在雨天也能採草莓。","part":"A","sec":"Soil, Water & Farm Equipment 土壤、水與農具","lab":"A54","t":"塑膠布棚"},{"w":"pitchfork","pos":"n.","def":"a tool with long metal points used to lift hay","cn":"乾草叉","s":"The farmer lifted the hay with a ________ and threw it into the barn, while his dog ran around barking happily.","zh":"農夫用乾草叉把乾草叉起來丟進穀倉，而他的狗在旁邊開心地跑來跑去吠叫。","part":"A","sec":"Soil, Water & Farm Equipment 土壤、水與農具","lab":"A55","t":"乾草叉"},{"w":"trough","pos":"n.","def":"a long open container for animals' food or water","cn":"飼料槽；水槽","s":"Every morning the farmer fills the ________ with fresh water, and the thirsty pigs push each other to drink first.","zh":"每天早上農夫把水槽裝滿清水，而口渴的豬會互相推擠搶著先喝。","part":"A","sec":"Soil, Water & Farm Equipment 土壤、水與農具","lab":"A56","t":"水槽"},{"w":"fertility","pos":"n.","def":"the ability of land to produce good crops","cn":"肥沃度；地力","s":"Volcanic ash can increase the ________ of the land, which is why farmers still grow crops near active volcanoes despite the danger.","zh":"火山灰能提高土地的肥沃度，這就是為什麼儘管有危險，農民仍在活火山附近種植作物。","part":"A","sec":"Soil, Water & Farm Equipment 土壤、水與農具","lab":"A57","t":"肥沃度"},{"w":"dairy","pos":"adj.","def":"made from milk, or connected with producing milk","cn":"乳製品的；酪農的","s":"Cheese, yoghurt and butter are all ________ products, so people who cannot drink milk often have trouble eating them too.","zh":"起司、優格和奶油都是乳製品，所以不能喝牛奶的人常常也很難吃這些東西。","part":"A","sec":"Livestock & Animal Farming 畜牧與動物養殖","lab":"A58","t":"乳製"},{"w":"pasture","pos":"n.","def":"land covered with grass where animals feed","cn":"牧場；牧草地","s":"The cows spend the day on the green ________, and in the evening the farmer leads them back to the barn for milking.","zh":"乳牛整天待在綠色的牧草地上，到了傍晚農夫再帶牠們回到牛舍擠奶。","part":"A","sec":"Livestock & Animal Farming 畜牧與動物養殖","lab":"A59","t":"牧草地"},{"w":"meadow","pos":"n.","def":"a field of grass and wild flowers","cn":"草地；草原","s":"We had a picnic in a ________ full of wild flowers, but we had to leave quickly because a group of curious goats came over.","zh":"我們在一片開滿野花的草地上野餐，但因為一群好奇的山羊跑了過來，我們只好趕快離開。","part":"A","sec":"Livestock & Animal Farming 畜牧與動物養殖","lab":"A60","t":"草地"},{"w":"fodder","pos":"n.","def":"food such as hay given to farm animals","cn":"（家畜）飼料；草料","s":"The dry winter left little grass on the hills, so farmers had to buy ________ to keep their sheep alive.","zh":"乾燥的冬天讓山坡上幾乎沒有草，所以農民必須購買草料來讓羊存活。","part":"A","sec":"Livestock & Animal Farming 畜牧與動物養殖","lab":"A61","t":"草料"},{"w":"hay","pos":"n.","def":"grass that has been cut and dried to feed animals","cn":"乾草","s":"The farmers cut the grass in summer and dry it into ________, so the horses have enough food during the cold months.","zh":"農民在夏天割草並曬成乾草，所以馬匹在寒冷的月份有足夠的食物。","part":"A","sec":"Livestock & Animal Farming 畜牧與動物養殖","lab":"A62","t":"乾草"},{"w":"silage","pos":"n.","def":"green plants stored without air and used as animal food","cn":"青貯飼料","s":"The farmer wraps the fresh grass in plastic to make ________, and the cows eat it happily all winter.","zh":"農夫把新鮮的牧草用塑膠包起來做成青貯飼料，而乳牛整個冬天都吃得很開心。","part":"A","sec":"Livestock & Animal Farming 畜牧與動物養殖","lab":"A63","t":"青貯飼料"},{"w":"pigsty","pos":"n.","def":"a small building or area where pigs are kept","cn":"豬圈","s":"The old ________ behind the farmhouse was cleaned every day, but the smell still reached the neighbours when the wind blew.","zh":"農舍後面的舊豬圈每天都會清理，但風一吹，臭味還是會飄到鄰居家。","part":"A","sec":"Livestock & Animal Farming 畜牧與動物養殖","lab":"A64","t":"豬圈"},{"w":"chicken coop","pos":"n.","def":"a small house where chickens are kept","cn":"雞舍；雞籠","s":"We built a ________ in the backyard last year, and now we collect fresh eggs every morning before school.","zh":"我們去年在後院蓋了一個雞舍，現在每天早上上學前都能撿到新鮮雞蛋。","part":"A","sec":"Livestock & Animal Farming 畜牧與動物養殖","lab":"A65","t":"雞舍"},{"w":"battery cage","pos":"n.","def":"a very small cage where egg-laying hens are kept","cn":"層架式雞籠（格子籠）","s":"Hens in a ________ cannot even spread their wings, so many shoppers now choose eggs from farms that let chickens walk around.","zh":"關在格子籠裡的母雞連翅膀都無法張開，所以現在許多消費者選擇讓雞可以四處走動的農場所生產的雞蛋。","part":"A","sec":"Livestock & Animal Farming 畜牧與動物養殖","lab":"A66","t":"格子籠"},{"w":"free-range","pos":"adj.","def":"(of farm animals) allowed to move around outside","cn":"放養的；放牧的","s":"________ eggs cost a little more at the supermarket, but my mother buys them because she believes the hens live happier lives.","zh":"放養雞蛋在超市貴一點，但我媽媽還是會買，因為她相信那些母雞過得比較快樂。","part":"A","sec":"Livestock & Animal Farming 畜牧與動物養殖","lab":"A67","t":"放養"},{"w":"slaughterhouse","pos":"n.","def":"a building where animals are killed for meat","cn":"屠宰場","s":"The town's old ________ closed ten years ago, and it has now been turned into a cafe and art space.","zh":"鎮上的舊屠宰場十年前關閉了，而它現在已經改建成咖啡廳和藝術空間。","part":"A","sec":"Livestock & Animal Farming 畜牧與動物養殖","lab":"A68","t":"屠宰場"},{"w":"slaughter","pos":"v.","def":"to kill animals for food","cn":"屠宰","s":"Farmers in the village used to ________ a pig before Lunar New Year, and every family received some meat for the celebrations.","zh":"村裡的農民以前會在農曆新年前屠宰一頭豬，而且每戶人家都能分到一些肉來過節。","part":"A","sec":"Livestock & Animal Farming 畜牧與動物養殖","lab":"A69","t":"屠宰"},{"w":"butcher","pos":"n.","def":"a person who cuts and sells meat","cn":"肉販；屠夫","s":"The ________ at the morning market cuts the pork exactly the way my grandmother likes it, so she never buys meat anywhere else.","zh":"早市的肉販會完全照我奶奶喜歡的方式切豬肉，所以她從不在別的地方買肉。","part":"A","sec":"Livestock & Animal Farming 畜牧與動物養殖","lab":"A70","t":"肉販"},{"w":"rear","pos":"v.","def":"to look after animals until they are fully grown","cn":"飼養；養育","s":"Their family has ________ ducks in Yilan for many years, and their duck meat is famous all over the county.","zh":"他們家在宜蘭養鴨已經很多年了，而且他們的鴨肉在全縣都很有名。","part":"A","sec":"Livestock & Animal Farming 畜牧與動物養殖","lab":"A71","t":"養"},{"w":"fatten","pos":"v.","def":"to make an animal fat before it is killed for food","cn":"養肥","s":"Some farmers ________ their cattle with corn for months, but grass-fed beef is becoming more popular because it is seen as healthier.","zh":"有些農民用玉米把牛養肥好幾個月，但草飼牛肉越來越受歡迎，因為它被認為比較健康。","part":"A","sec":"Livestock & Animal Farming 畜牧與動物養殖","lab":"A72","t":"養肥"},{"w":"antibiotic","pos":"n.","def":"a medicine that kills bacteria","cn":"抗生素","s":"If farmers give animals an ________ too often, bacteria may become stronger, and medicines may stop working for humans too.","zh":"如果農民太常給動物使用抗生素，細菌可能會變得更強，而藥物對人類也可能失效。","part":"A","sec":"Livestock & Animal Farming 畜牧與動物養殖","lab":"A73","t":"抗生素"},{"w":"growth hormone","pos":"n.","def":"a chemical that makes animals grow bigger faster","cn":"生長激素","s":"Some countries allow farmers to give cattle ________, but others have banned it because people worry about the effects on health.","zh":"有些國家允許農民給牛使用生長激素，但其他國家已經禁止，因為人們擔心它對健康的影響。","part":"A","sec":"Livestock & Animal Farming 畜牧與動物養殖","lab":"A74","t":"生長激素"},{"w":"animal welfare","pos":"n.","def":"the health and comfort of animals","cn":"動物福利","s":"The supermarket now sells eggs with an ________ label, so customers can see that the hens were treated kindly.","zh":"這間超市現在販售貼有動物福利標章的雞蛋，所以顧客可以知道母雞受到善待。","part":"A","sec":"Livestock & Animal Farming 畜牧與動物養殖","lab":"A75","t":"動物福利"},{"w":"factory farming","pos":"n.","def":"keeping large numbers of animals indoors to produce cheap food","cn":"工廠化養殖","s":"________ produces cheap meat for millions of people, but critics say the animals suffer because they have so little space.","zh":"工廠化養殖為數百萬人生產便宜的肉品，但批評者說動物因為空間太小而受苦。","part":"A","sec":"Livestock & Animal Farming 畜牧與動物養殖","lab":"A76","t":"工廠化養殖"},{"w":"shear / sheared / shorn","pos":"v.","def":"to cut the wool off a sheep","cn":"剪（羊毛）","s":"The farmers ________ the sheep every spring, so the animals stay cool in summer and the wool can be sold.","zh":"農民每年春天替羊剪毛，所以羊在夏天能保持涼爽，羊毛也可以拿去賣。","part":"A","sec":"Livestock & Animal Farming 畜牧與動物養殖","lab":"A77","t":"剪毛"},{"w":"fleece","pos":"n.","def":"the wool coat of a sheep","cn":"羊毛（整片）","s":"Each ________ was washed and dried in the sun, and then the women spun it into thread for warm winter sweaters.","zh":"每一片羊毛都經過清洗並在陽光下曬乾，然後婦女們把它紡成線，用來織保暖的冬季毛衣。","part":"A","sec":"Livestock & Animal Farming 畜牧與動物養殖","lab":"A78","t":"羊毛"},{"w":"hatchery","pos":"n.","def":"a place where eggs are kept warm until young birds or fish come out","cn":"孵化場","s":"The ________ produces thousands of baby chickens every day, and they are sent to farms all over the island by truck.","zh":"這座孵化場每天生產數千隻小雞，然後用卡車送到全島各地的農場。","part":"A","sec":"Livestock & Animal Farming 畜牧與動物養殖","lab":"A79","t":"孵化場"},{"w":"broiler","pos":"n.","def":"a young chicken raised for its meat","cn":"肉雞","s":"A modern ________ grows so quickly that it is ready to sell in about six weeks, but some people think this is unnatural.","zh":"現代的肉雞長得非常快，大約六週就可以出售，但有些人認為這很不自然。","part":"A","sec":"Livestock & Animal Farming 畜牧與動物養殖","lab":"A80","t":"肉雞"},{"w":"beekeeping","pos":"n.","def":"the work of keeping bees for honey","cn":"養蜂","s":"My uncle took up ________ after he retired, and now he gives jars of honey to all his friends at Mid-Autumn Festival.","zh":"我舅舅退休後開始養蜂，現在每到中秋節他都會送朋友們一罐罐蜂蜜。","part":"A","sec":"Livestock & Animal Farming 畜牧與動物養殖","lab":"A81","t":"養蜂"},{"w":"beehive","pos":"n.","def":"a box or structure where bees live and make honey","cn":"蜂巢；蜂箱","s":"The farmer placed a ________ at the edge of the orchard, because the bees help the fruit trees and also produce honey.","zh":"農夫在果園邊緣放了一個蜂箱，因為蜜蜂能幫助果樹授粉，也能生產蜂蜜。","part":"A","sec":"Livestock & Animal Farming 畜牧與動物養殖","lab":"A82","t":"蜂箱"},{"w":"milking machine","pos":"n.","def":"a machine used to take milk from cows","cn":"擠奶機","s":"The farm bought a ________ last year, so the workers no longer get up at four o'clock to milk the cows by hand.","zh":"這座農場去年買了一台擠奶機，所以工人不再需要凌晨四點起床用手擠牛奶。","part":"A","sec":"Livestock & Animal Farming 畜牧與動物養殖","lab":"A83","t":"擠奶機"},{"w":"ranch","pos":"n.","def":"a very large farm for raising cattle, horses or sheep","cn":"大牧場","s":"My cousin worked on a cattle ________ in Australia for a year, and he learned to ride a horse and fix fences.","zh":"我表哥在澳洲的養牛大牧場工作了一年，而且學會了騎馬和修理圍籬。","part":"A","sec":"Livestock & Animal Farming 畜牧與動物養殖","lab":"A84","t":"大牧場"},{"w":"lamb","pos":"n.","def":"a young sheep, or its meat","cn":"小羊；羊肉","s":"The newborn ________ could stand up within an hour, and the children watched quietly as it drank milk from its mother.","zh":"這隻剛出生的小羊不到一小時就能站起來，孩子們靜靜地看著牠喝母羊的奶。","part":"A","sec":"Livestock & Animal Farming 畜牧與動物養殖","lab":"A85","t":"小羊"},{"w":"processed food","pos":"n.","def":"food changed by factory methods, often with added chemicals","cn":"加工食品","s":"Instant noodles are a common ________, and they are cheap and quick, but they often contain a lot of salt.","zh":"泡麵是常見的加工食品，它們既便宜又快速，但常常含有大量的鹽。","part":"A","sec":"Food Processing & Preservation 食品加工與保存","lab":"A86","t":"加工食品"},{"w":"ultra-processed","pos":"adj.","def":"made mostly from factory ingredients rather than whole foods","cn":"超加工的","s":"Many snacks in convenience stores are ________, so doctors advise teenagers to eat fruit and nuts instead.","zh":"便利商店的許多零食都是超加工的，所以醫生建議青少年改吃水果和堅果。","part":"A","sec":"Food Processing & Preservation 食品加工與保存","lab":"A87","t":"超加工的"},{"w":"preservative","pos":"n.","def":"a chemical added to food to stop it from going bad","cn":"防腐劑","s":"This bread contains no ________, so it goes mouldy after three days, but my family thinks it tastes much fresher.","zh":"這種麵包不含防腐劑，所以三天後就會發霉，但我們家覺得它吃起來新鮮多了。","part":"A","sec":"Food Processing & Preservation 食品加工與保存","lab":"A88","t":"防腐劑"},{"w":"additive","pos":"n.","def":"a substance added to food to improve its colour, taste or life","cn":"添加物","s":"The label lists every ________ in the drink, but most customers do not read it because the words are very small.","zh":"標籤上列出了飲料中的每一種添加物，但大多數顧客都不會去看，因為字實在太小了。","part":"A","sec":"Food Processing & Preservation 食品加工與保存","lab":"A89","t":"添加物"},{"w":"flavouring","pos":"n.","def":"a substance added to food to give it a particular taste","cn":"調味料；香料","s":"The strawberry milk contains no real fruit, only artificial ________, but children still love its sweet pink colour.","zh":"這種草莓牛奶完全不含真的水果，只有人工香料，但孩子們還是很喜歡它甜甜的粉紅色。","part":"A","sec":"Food Processing & Preservation 食品加工與保存","lab":"A90","t":"香料"},{"w":"sweetener","pos":"n.","def":"a substance used instead of sugar to make food sweet","cn":"甜味劑","s":"Diet cola uses an artificial ________ instead of sugar, so it has almost no calories, but some people dislike the taste.","zh":"無糖可樂使用人工甜味劑代替糖，所以幾乎沒有熱量，但有些人不喜歡它的味道。","part":"A","sec":"Food Processing & Preservation 食品加工與保存","lab":"A91","t":"甜味劑"},{"w":"emulsifier","pos":"n.","def":"a substance that helps oil and water mix together","cn":"乳化劑","s":"Ice cream often contains an ________, because without it the cream and water would separate and the texture would become icy.","zh":"冰淇淋常含有乳化劑，因為如果沒有它，奶油和水會分離，口感也會變得像冰渣。","part":"A","sec":"Food Processing & Preservation 食品加工與保存","lab":"A92","t":"乳化劑"},{"w":"pasteurise","pos":"v.","def":"to heat milk or juice to kill harmful bacteria","cn":"巴氏殺菌","s":"Dairy farms ________ milk before it goes to shops, because heating it kills bacteria that could make people sick.","zh":"酪農場會在牛奶送到商店前先進行巴氏殺菌，因為加熱能殺死可能使人生病的細菌。","part":"A","sec":"Food Processing & Preservation 食品加工與保存","lab":"A93","t":"巴氏殺菌"},{"w":"sterilise","pos":"v.","def":"to make something completely free from bacteria","cn":"消毒；殺菌","s":"My mother always ________ the glass jars in boiling water before she makes jam, so the jam will not go bad.","zh":"我媽媽做果醬前總會先把玻璃罐放進滾水中消毒，這樣果醬才不會壞掉。","part":"A","sec":"Food Processing & Preservation 食品加工與保存","lab":"A94","t":"消毒"},{"w":"freezer","pos":"n.","def":"a machine or part of a fridge that keeps food frozen","cn":"冷凍庫","s":"We keep dumplings in the ________ for busy evenings, and we can cook a quick dinner in ten minutes.","zh":"我們把水餃放在冷凍庫裡備著忙碌的晚上吃，而且十分鐘就能煮好一頓快速的晚餐。","part":"A","sec":"Food Processing & Preservation 食品加工與保存","lab":"A95","t":"冷凍庫"},{"w":"defrost","pos":"v.","def":"to let frozen food become soft again","cn":"解凍","s":"You should ________ the chicken in the fridge overnight, because leaving it on the table can allow bacteria to grow.","zh":"你應該把雞肉放在冷藏室裡隔夜解凍，因為把它放在桌上可能會讓細菌滋生。","part":"A","sec":"Food Processing & Preservation 食品加工與保存","lab":"A96","t":"解凍"},{"w":"chilled","pos":"adj.","def":"kept cold but not frozen","cn":"冷藏的；冰鎮的","s":"________ salads must stay below five degrees, so the delivery driver checks the temperature in his van every hour.","zh":"冷藏沙拉必須保持在五度以下，所以送貨司機每小時都會檢查貨車內的溫度。","part":"A","sec":"Food Processing & Preservation 食品加工與保存","lab":"A97","t":"冷藏"},{"w":"cold chain","pos":"n.","def":"a system that keeps food cold from farm to shop","cn":"冷鏈","s":"Vaccines and fresh fish both depend on the ________, because even a short break in cooling can make them unsafe.","zh":"疫苗和鮮魚都仰賴冷鏈，因為即使冷藏只中斷一下，也可能讓它們變得不安全。","part":"A","sec":"Food Processing & Preservation 食品加工與保存","lab":"A98","t":"冷鏈"},{"w":"vacuum-packed","pos":"adj.","def":"sealed in a pack with all the air removed","cn":"真空包裝的","s":"The ________ meat stays fresh for weeks because no air can get in, so campers often take it on long trips.","zh":"真空包裝的肉能保鮮好幾週，因為空氣進不去，所以露營者常帶著它去長途旅行。","part":"A","sec":"Food Processing & Preservation 食品加工與保存","lab":"A99","t":"真空包裝的"},{"w":"airtight","pos":"adj.","def":"not allowing air to get in or out","cn":"密封的；不透氣的","s":"Keep the cookies in an ________ box, or they will become soft because of the wet weather in Taipei.","zh":"把餅乾放在密封的盒子裡，否則它們會因為台北潮濕的天氣而變軟。","part":"A","sec":"Food Processing & Preservation 食品加工與保存","lab":"A100","t":"密封的"},{"w":"dehydrate","pos":"v.","def":"to remove water from food to keep it longer","cn":"使脫水；乾燥","s":"Factories ________ fruit to make healthy snacks, and the dried mango slices from Tainan are popular gifts for tourists.","zh":"工廠將水果脫水製成健康的點心，而台南的芒果乾片是很受觀光客歡迎的伴手禮。","part":"A","sec":"Food Processing & Preservation 食品加工與保存","lab":"A101","t":"脫水"},{"w":"cure","pos":"v.","def":"to keep meat or fish by drying, salting or smoking it","cn":"醃製；燻製","s":"Families in the countryside ________ pork with salt and spices before winter, so they have meat to eat during the holidays.","zh":"鄉下的家庭會在冬天前用鹽和香料醃製豬肉，這樣過節時就有肉可吃。","part":"A","sec":"Food Processing & Preservation 食品加工與保存","lab":"A102","t":"醃製"},{"w":"pickle","pos":"v.","def":"to keep food in vinegar or salt water","cn":"醃漬","s":"My grandmother likes to ________ cucumbers in summer, and she keeps the jars in a cool cupboard for months.","zh":"我奶奶喜歡在夏天醃漬小黃瓜，而且她把罐子放在陰涼的櫥櫃裡好幾個月。","part":"A","sec":"Food Processing & Preservation 食品加工與保存","lab":"A103","t":"醃漬"},{"w":"ferment","pos":"v.","def":"to change chemically because of bacteria or yeast","cn":"發酵","s":"Cabbage is left to ________ for several days to make kimchi, and the bacteria give it a sour taste that many people love.","zh":"高麗菜會放著發酵好幾天來做成泡菜，而細菌讓它產生許多人喜愛的酸味。","part":"A","sec":"Food Processing & Preservation 食品加工與保存","lab":"A104","t":"發酵"},{"w":"shelf life","pos":"n.","def":"how long a product can be kept before it goes bad","cn":"保存期限；架售期","s":"Canned soup has a long ________, so people often buy it before a typhoon, but fresh milk must be drunk within a week.","zh":"罐頭湯的保存期限很長，所以人們常在颱風前購買，但鮮奶必須在一週內喝完。","part":"A","sec":"Food Processing & Preservation 食品加工與保存","lab":"A105","t":"保存期限"},{"w":"best-before date","pos":"n.","def":"the date until which food is at its best quality","cn":"最佳賞味期限","s":"The yoghurt was two days past its ________, but it still smelled fine, so we decided to eat it.","zh":"這罐優格已經過了最佳賞味期限兩天，但聞起來還是沒問題，所以我們決定把它吃掉。","part":"A","sec":"Food Processing & Preservation 食品加工與保存","lab":"A106","t":"最佳賞味期限"},{"w":"spoil","pos":"v.","def":"(of food) to become bad and unsafe to eat","cn":"（食物）變質；壞掉","s":"Fresh fish can ________ within hours in summer, so the fishermen pack it in ice as soon as it is caught.","zh":"新鮮的魚在夏天幾小時內就可能壞掉，所以漁夫一捕到魚就立刻用冰塊包裝。","part":"A","sec":"Food Processing & Preservation 食品加工與保存","lab":"A107","t":"壞掉"},{"w":"rotten","pos":"adj.","def":"old and bad, and no longer fit to eat","cn":"腐爛的","s":"We found a ________ apple at the bottom of the bag, and it had already spoiled several others around it.","zh":"我們在袋子底部發現了一顆腐爛的蘋果，而它已經把周圍好幾顆都弄壞了。","part":"A","sec":"Food Processing & Preservation 食品加工與保存","lab":"A108","t":"腐爛的"},{"w":"stale","pos":"adj.","def":"(of bread or snacks) no longer fresh and becoming dry or hard","cn":"不新鮮的；走味的","s":"The bread had gone ________ because nobody closed the bag, so we fed it to the ducks in the park.","zh":"因為沒有人把袋子封好，麵包變得不新鮮了，所以我們拿去公園餵鴨子。","part":"A","sec":"Food Processing & Preservation 食品加工與保存","lab":"A109","t":"不新鮮"},{"w":"perishable","pos":"adj.","def":"likely to go bad quickly","cn":"易腐壞的","s":"Strawberries are very ________, so farmers have to sell them within a few days, or they will lose their money.","zh":"草莓非常容易腐壞，所以農民必須在幾天內賣掉，否則就會虧錢。","part":"A","sec":"Food Processing & Preservation 食品加工與保存","lab":"A110","t":"容易腐壞"},{"w":"flour","pos":"n.","def":"powder made from grain and used for baking","cn":"麵粉","s":"We mixed ________, eggs and milk to make pancakes, but the kitchen was covered in white powder by the time we finished.","zh":"我們把麵粉、雞蛋和牛奶混在一起做鬆餅，但等我們做完時，廚房已經滿是白色粉末。","part":"A","sec":"Food Processing & Preservation 食品加工與保存","lab":"A111","t":"麵粉"},{"w":"grind / ground / ground","pos":"v.","def":"to crush something into small pieces or powder","cn":"磨碎；研磨","s":"The cafe owner ________ the coffee beans just before he makes each cup, because he says it gives a much better smell.","zh":"這位咖啡店老闆在沖每杯咖啡前才研磨咖啡豆，因為他說這樣香氣會好得多。","part":"A","sec":"Food Processing & Preservation 食品加工與保存","lab":"A112","t":"研磨"},{"w":"bottled","pos":"adj.","def":"sold in bottles","cn":"瓶裝的","s":"Many tourists buy ________ water every day, but the city now provides free water stations to cut down on plastic waste.","zh":"許多觀光客每天都買瓶裝水，但這座城市現在提供免費飲水站來減少塑膠垃圾。","part":"A","sec":"Food Processing & Preservation 食品加工與保存","lab":"A113","t":"瓶裝"},{"w":"quick-freezing","pos":"n.","def":"freezing food very fast to keep its taste and texture","cn":"急速冷凍","s":"________ keeps vegetables bright and crunchy, because the ice crystals stay tiny and do not damage the cells.","zh":"急速冷凍能讓蔬菜保持鮮豔和爽脆，因為冰晶很小，不會破壞細胞。","part":"A","sec":"Food Processing & Preservation 食品加工與保存","lab":"A114","t":"急速冷凍"},{"w":"food technology","pos":"n.","def":"the science of making, storing and improving food","cn":"食品科技","s":"Advances in ________ have made food safer and cheaper, but some people prefer traditional cooking because it feels more natural.","zh":"食品科技的進步讓食物更安全也更便宜，但有些人比較喜歡傳統烹調，因為感覺比較天然。","part":"A","sec":"Food Technology & Innovation 食品科技與創新","lab":"A115","t":"食品科技"},{"w":"food scientist","pos":"n.","def":"a person who studies how food is made and kept safe","cn":"食品科學家","s":"A ________ tested the new sauce for months, and she changed the recipe because the colour faded too quickly.","zh":"一位食品科學家花了好幾個月測試這款新醬料，她更改了配方，因為顏色褪得太快。","part":"A","sec":"Food Technology & Innovation 食品科技與創新","lab":"A116","t":"食品科學家"},{"w":"lab-grown meat","pos":"n.","def":"meat made from animal cells in a laboratory","cn":"實驗室培育肉","s":"________ could reduce the number of animals that are killed, but it is still too expensive for most families to buy.","zh":"實驗室培育肉可以減少被宰殺的動物數量，但對大多數家庭來說還是太貴了。","part":"A","sec":"Food Technology & Innovation 食品科技與創新","lab":"A117","t":"實驗室培育肉"},{"w":"plant-based","pos":"adj.","def":"made from plants rather than animals","cn":"植物性的；以植物為原料的","s":"The burger shop now offers a ________ burger, and many customers cannot tell the difference from beef.","zh":"這家漢堡店現在提供植物性漢堡，而且許多顧客都吃不出它和牛肉的差別。","part":"A","sec":"Food Technology & Innovation 食品科技與創新","lab":"A118","t":"植物性"},{"w":"meat substitute","pos":"n.","def":"a food that is used instead of meat","cn":"肉類替代品","s":"Tofu has been a popular ________ in Asia for centuries, so new plant-based products are not really a new idea here.","zh":"豆腐在亞洲作為肉類替代品已經流行了好幾個世紀，所以新的植物性產品在這裡其實不算新點子。","part":"A","sec":"Food Technology & Innovation 食品科技與創新","lab":"A119","t":"肉類替代品"},{"w":"alternative protein","pos":"n.","def":"a source of protein other than traditional meat","cn":"替代蛋白質","s":"Investors are spending billions on ________ because the world's population is growing, and farms cannot produce enough meat for everyone.","zh":"投資人在替代蛋白質上投入數十億元，因為世界人口持續成長，而農場無法生產足夠所有人吃的肉。","part":"A","sec":"Food Technology & Innovation 食品科技與創新","lab":"A120","t":"替代蛋白質"},{"w":"edible insect","pos":"n.","def":"an insect that is safe for people to eat","cn":"可食用昆蟲","s":"Crickets are an ________ that is rich in protein, but many people in Taiwan still feel nervous about tasting them.","zh":"蟋蟀是一種富含蛋白質的可食用昆蟲，但許多台灣人對品嘗牠們仍然感到緊張。","part":"A","sec":"Food Technology & Innovation 食品科技與創新","lab":"A121","t":"可食用昆蟲"},{"w":"genetically modified","pos":"adj.","def":"having genes changed by scientists","cn":"基因改造的","s":"Most of the soybeans that Taiwan imports are ________, so tofu makers must label clearly which products use them.","zh":"台灣進口的黃豆大多是基因改造的，所以豆腐業者必須清楚標示哪些產品有使用。","part":"A","sec":"Food Technology & Innovation 食品科技與創新","lab":"A122","t":"基因改造的"},{"w":"GMO","pos":"n.","def":"a living thing whose genes have been changed by science","cn":"基因改造生物","s":"School lunches in Taiwan cannot contain any ________, because parents asked the government to make this rule several years ago.","zh":"台灣的學校午餐不能含有任何基因改造生物，因為家長幾年前要求政府訂定這項規定。","part":"A","sec":"Food Technology & Innovation 食品科技與創新","lab":"A123","t":"基因改造生物"},{"w":"gene editing","pos":"n.","def":"changing the DNA of a living thing in a precise way","cn":"基因編輯","s":"Scientists are using ________ to create rice that survives floods, and farmers in Asia hope it will protect their harvests.","zh":"科學家正在運用基因編輯培育能在洪水中存活的稻米，而亞洲的農民希望它能保護他們的收成。","part":"A","sec":"Food Technology & Innovation 食品科技與創新","lab":"A124","t":"基因編輯"},{"w":"biotechnology","pos":"n.","def":"using living cells and bacteria to make useful products","cn":"生物科技","s":"My sister wants to study ________ at university, because she believes it can help farmers grow food with fewer chemicals.","zh":"我姊姊想在大學攻讀生物科技，因為她相信它能幫助農民用更少的化學物質種植糧食。","part":"A","sec":"Food Technology & Innovation 食品科技與創新","lab":"A125","t":"生物科技"},{"w":"hydroponics","pos":"n.","def":"growing plants in water with nutrients instead of soil","cn":"水耕栽培","s":"The restaurant grows its own lettuce using ________, so it needs no soil, and the leaves are picked just before serving.","zh":"這家餐廳用水耕栽培自己種萵苣，所以不需要土壤，而且葉子是上菜前才採下的。","part":"A","sec":"Food Technology & Innovation 食品科技與創新","lab":"A126","t":"水耕栽培"},{"w":"aquaponics","pos":"n.","def":"a system where fish and plants are raised together in water","cn":"魚菜共生","s":"Our school built an ________ system in the science lab, and the students feed the fish while the plants clean the water.","zh":"我們學校在科學實驗室裡建造了一套魚菜共生系統，學生餵魚，而植物則負責淨化水質。","part":"A","sec":"Food Technology & Innovation 食品科技與創新","lab":"A127","t":"魚菜共生"},{"w":"vertical farming","pos":"n.","def":"growing crops in stacked layers, often inside buildings","cn":"垂直農法","s":"________ allows cities to produce vegetables in tall buildings, but the lights use a lot of electricity, so costs remain high.","zh":"垂直農法讓城市能在高樓裡生產蔬菜，但照明耗電量很大，所以成本仍然很高。","part":"A","sec":"Food Technology & Innovation 食品科技與創新","lab":"A128","t":"垂直農法"},{"w":"indoor farm","pos":"n.","def":"a farm inside a building with controlled light and temperature","cn":"室內農場","s":"The ________ near the train station grows herbs all year round, and typhoons cannot damage the crops because they are inside.","zh":"火車站附近的室內農場全年都在種植香草，而且颱風也無法破壞作物，因為它們都在室內。","part":"A","sec":"Food Technology & Innovation 食品科技與創新","lab":"A129","t":"室內農場"},{"w":"precision agriculture","pos":"n.","def":"farming that uses data and technology to treat each part of a field correctly","cn":"精準農業","s":"With ________, farmers use drones and sensors to find dry areas, so they only water the plants that really need it.","zh":"透過精準農業，農民使用無人機和感測器找出乾燥的區域，所以他們只澆灌真正需要水的植物。","part":"A","sec":"Food Technology & Innovation 食品科技與創新","lab":"A130","t":"精準農業"},{"w":"agritech","pos":"n.","def":"technology used to improve farming","cn":"農業科技","s":"Young engineers are starting ________ companies in Taiwan, and they hope their apps will help older farmers save time and water.","zh":"年輕工程師在台灣創立農業科技公司，而他們希望自己的應用程式能幫助年長的農民節省時間和水。","part":"A","sec":"Food Technology & Innovation 食品科技與創新","lab":"A131","t":"農業科技"},{"w":"smart farming","pos":"n.","def":"farming with connected devices that collect and share data","cn":"智慧農業","s":"________ lets my uncle check the temperature of his greenhouse on his phone, so he can relax even when he travels.","zh":"智慧農業讓我叔叔能用手機查看溫室的溫度，所以他即使出門旅行也能放心。","part":"A","sec":"Food Technology & Innovation 食品科技與創新","lab":"A132","t":"智慧農業"},{"w":"high-yield","pos":"adj.","def":"producing a large amount of crops","cn":"高產量的","s":"Scientists developed ________ rice in the 1960s, and it helped millions of people in Asia escape hunger.","zh":"科學家在1960年代培育出高產量的稻米，而它幫助亞洲數百萬人擺脫飢餓。","part":"A","sec":"Food Technology & Innovation 食品科技與創新","lab":"A133","t":"高產量的"},{"w":"hybrid","pos":"n.","def":"a plant or animal produced from two different types","cn":"雜交種；混種","s":"This papaya is a ________ of two local types, so it is both sweet and strong enough to survive the windy season.","zh":"這種木瓜是兩個本地品種的雜交種，所以它既甜又強壯，能撐過多風的季節。","part":"A","sec":"Food Technology & Innovation 食品科技與創新","lab":"A134","t":"雜交種"},{"w":"seed bank","pos":"n.","def":"a place where seeds are stored to protect plant varieties","cn":"種子庫","s":"A ________ in Norway keeps millions of seeds deep inside a mountain, so crops can be replanted if a disaster happens.","zh":"挪威的一座種子庫將數百萬顆種子保存在山的深處，所以如果發生災難，作物就能重新種植。","part":"A","sec":"Food Technology & Innovation 食品科技與創新","lab":"A135","t":"種子庫"},{"w":"Green Revolution","pos":"n.","def":"the rapid rise in crop production in the 1960s using new seeds and chemicals","cn":"綠色革命","s":"The ________ doubled rice harvests in many countries, but it also increased the use of chemicals and water.","zh":"綠色革命讓許多國家的稻米收成加倍，但它也增加了化學物質和水的使用量。","part":"A","sec":"Food Technology & Innovation 食品科技與創新","lab":"A136","t":"綠色革命"},{"w":"agrochemical","pos":"n.","def":"a chemical used in farming, such as a fertiliser or pesticide","cn":"農用化學品","s":"The company sells every kind of ________ to farmers, but it is also developing natural products because customers want safer food.","zh":"這家公司向農民銷售各種農用化學品，但它也在研發天然產品，因為消費者想要更安全的食物。","part":"A","sec":"Food Technology & Innovation 食品科技與創新","lab":"A137","t":"農用化學品"},{"w":"mycoprotein","pos":"n.","def":"protein made from a type of fungus, used instead of meat","cn":"真菌蛋白","s":"The vegetarian nuggets are made from ________, and they taste surprisingly like chicken, so even my meat-loving father enjoyed them.","zh":"這款素雞塊是用真菌蛋白做的，而且吃起來出奇地像雞肉，所以連愛吃肉的爸爸都很喜歡。","part":"A","sec":"Food Technology & Innovation 食品科技與創新","lab":"A138","t":"真菌蛋白"},{"w":"superfood","pos":"n.","def":"a food said to be especially good for your health","cn":"超級食物","s":"Blueberries are often called a ________, but nutritionists say that a balanced diet matters more than any single fruit.","zh":"藍莓常被稱為超級食物，但營養師說均衡飲食比任何單一水果都更重要。","part":"A","sec":"Food Technology & Innovation 食品科技與創新","lab":"A139","t":"超級食物"},{"w":"3D food printing","pos":"n.","def":"making food in shapes using a machine that builds it in layers","cn":"3D食物列印","s":"The hotel used ________ to make chocolate in the shape of Taipei 101, and the guests took photos before they ate it.","zh":"這家飯店運用3D食物列印做出台北101形狀的巧克力，客人在吃之前都先拍了照。","part":"A","sec":"Food Technology & Innovation 食品科技與創新","lab":"A140","t":"3D食物列印"},{"w":"meal kit","pos":"n.","def":"a box of ingredients and a recipe delivered to your home","cn":"料理包；食材組","s":"My parents order a ________ every week because they are busy, and all the ingredients arrive already measured.","zh":"我爸媽因為很忙，每週都會訂一盒食材組，而且所有食材送來時都已經量好了。","part":"A","sec":"Food Technology & Innovation 食品科技與創新","lab":"A141","t":"食材組"},{"w":"food delivery app","pos":"n.","def":"a phone app used to order meals to your home","cn":"外送應用程式","s":"Students often use a ________ late at night, but the plastic boxes create a lot of rubbish.","zh":"學生常在深夜使用外送應用程式，但塑膠餐盒製造了大量垃圾。","part":"A","sec":"Food Technology & Innovation 食品科技與創新","lab":"A142","t":"外送應用程式"},{"w":"bioreactor","pos":"n.","def":"a large tank where cells or bacteria are grown","cn":"生物反應器","s":"The meat cells grow inside a steel ________ for several weeks, and scientists control the temperature very carefully.","zh":"肉類細胞在鋼製的生物反應器裡生長好幾個星期，而科學家會非常小心地控制溫度。","part":"A","sec":"Food Technology & Innovation 食品科技與創新","lab":"A143","t":"生物反應器"},{"w":"nutrition","pos":"n.","def":"the food you eat and how it affects your health","cn":"營養","s":"Good ________ is important for teenagers because they are still growing, so schools try to serve balanced lunches.","zh":"良好的營養對青少年很重要，因為他們還在成長，所以學校努力提供均衡的午餐。","part":"A","sec":"Nutrition, Diet & Food Safety 營養、飲食與食品安全","lab":"A144","t":"營養"},{"w":"nutritious","pos":"adj.","def":"full of things that are good for your body","cn":"有營養的","s":"Sweet potatoes are cheap and ________, so my grandmother says they helped many families survive during hard times.","zh":"地瓜既便宜又有營養，所以我奶奶說它在艱困時期幫助許多家庭活了下來。","part":"A","sec":"Nutrition, Diet & Food Safety 營養、飲食與食品安全","lab":"A145","t":"有營養"},{"w":"nutritionist","pos":"n.","def":"an expert on food and healthy eating","cn":"營養師","s":"The school ________ plans the lunch menu every month, and she makes sure there are vegetables in every meal.","zh":"學校的營養師每個月規劃午餐菜單，而且她確保每一餐都有蔬菜。","part":"A","sec":"Nutrition, Diet & Food Safety 營養、飲食與食品安全","lab":"A146","t":"營養師"},{"w":"balanced diet","pos":"n.","def":"eating the right amounts of different kinds of food","cn":"均衡飲食","s":"A ________ includes fruit, vegetables, grains and protein, so you should not live on fried chicken and bubble tea.","zh":"均衡飲食包括水果、蔬菜、穀物和蛋白質，所以你不應該只靠炸雞和珍珠奶茶過活。","part":"A","sec":"Nutrition, Diet & Food Safety 營養、飲食與食品安全","lab":"A147","t":"均衡飲食"},{"w":"protein","pos":"n.","def":"a nutrient in meat, eggs and beans that builds muscles","cn":"蛋白質","s":"Athletes need plenty of ________ to build muscle, so many of them eat eggs, chicken or tofu after training.","zh":"運動員需要大量的蛋白質來增加肌肉，所以他們許多人在訓練後吃雞蛋、雞肉或豆腐。","part":"A","sec":"Nutrition, Diet & Food Safety 營養、飲食與食品安全","lab":"A148","t":"蛋白質"},{"w":"carbohydrate","pos":"n.","def":"a nutrient in rice, bread and noodles that gives energy","cn":"碳水化合物","s":"Rice is the main ________ in many Asian meals, and it gives students the energy they need for long school days.","zh":"米飯是許多亞洲餐點中主要的碳水化合物，而且它提供學生漫長上學日所需的能量。","part":"A","sec":"Nutrition, Diet & Food Safety 營養、飲食與食品安全","lab":"A149","t":"碳水化合物"},{"w":"fibre","pos":"n.","def":"the part of plant food that helps digestion","cn":"纖維","s":"Brown rice contains more ________ than white rice, so it keeps you full for longer and helps your stomach work well.","zh":"糙米比白米含有更多纖維，所以能讓你飽得更久，也能幫助腸胃正常運作。","part":"A","sec":"Nutrition, Diet & Food Safety 營養、飲食與食品安全","lab":"A150","t":"纖維"},{"w":"vitamin","pos":"n.","def":"a natural substance in food that the body needs to stay healthy","cn":"維他命；維生素","s":"Oranges are full of ________ C, so my mother makes us eat one every day when it is flu season.","zh":"柳橙富含維他命C，所以在流感季節我媽媽每天都要我們吃一顆。","part":"A","sec":"Nutrition, Diet & Food Safety 營養、飲食與食品安全","lab":"A151","t":"維他命"},{"w":"calorie","pos":"n.","def":"a unit for measuring the energy in food","cn":"卡路里；熱量","s":"One cup of bubble tea can contain more than five hundred ________, so it is almost like eating a whole meal.","zh":"一杯珍珠奶茶可能含有超過五百卡路里，所以幾乎就像吃了一整餐。","part":"A","sec":"Nutrition, Diet & Food Safety 營養、飲食與食品安全","lab":"A152","t":"卡路里"},{"w":"sodium","pos":"n.","def":"a chemical in salt that can be unhealthy in large amounts","cn":"鈉","s":"Instant noodles are very high in ________, so doctors warn that eating them often may raise your blood pressure.","zh":"泡麵的鈉含量非常高，所以醫生警告常吃可能會讓血壓升高。","part":"A","sec":"Nutrition, Diet & Food Safety 營養、飲食與食品安全","lab":"A153","t":"鈉"},{"w":"cholesterol","pos":"n.","def":"a fatty substance in the blood that can block blood vessels","cn":"膽固醇","s":"My father's ________ was too high last year, so he stopped eating fried food and started jogging every morning.","zh":"我爸爸去年膽固醇太高，所以他不再吃油炸食物，並開始每天早上慢跑。","part":"A","sec":"Nutrition, Diet & Food Safety 營養、飲食與食品安全","lab":"A154","t":"膽固醇"},{"w":"obesity","pos":"n.","def":"the state of being very overweight","cn":"肥胖（症）","s":"Childhood ________ is rising in many countries, and experts blame sugary drinks as well as too much time on screens.","zh":"兒童肥胖在許多國家持續增加，而專家將原因歸咎於含糖飲料以及花太多時間在螢幕上。","part":"A","sec":"Nutrition, Diet & Food Safety 營養、飲食與食品安全","lab":"A155","t":"肥胖"},{"w":"food poisoning","pos":"n.","def":"illness caused by eating food that contains harmful bacteria","cn":"食物中毒","s":"Several students got ________ after the school trip, and the health department later found that the lunch boxes had been left in the sun.","zh":"好幾個學生在校外教學後食物中毒，而衛生局後來發現便當被放在太陽底下曬。","part":"A","sec":"Nutrition, Diet & Food Safety 營養、飲食與食品安全","lab":"A156","t":"食物中毒"},{"w":"salmonella","pos":"n.","def":"a type of bacteria that causes food poisoning","cn":"沙門氏菌","s":"Raw eggs may carry ________, so you should cook them properly, especially when you serve them to children.","zh":"生雞蛋可能帶有沙門氏菌，所以你應該把蛋煮熟，尤其是給小孩吃的時候。","part":"A","sec":"Nutrition, Diet & Food Safety 營養、飲食與食品安全","lab":"A157","t":"沙門氏菌"},{"w":"food safety","pos":"n.","def":"keeping food free from things that can make people ill","cn":"食品安全","s":"After several scandals about cooking oil, ________ became a major concern in Taiwan, and the government made stricter rules.","zh":"在幾起食用油醜聞之後，食品安全成為台灣重大的關注議題，而政府也訂定了更嚴格的規定。","part":"A","sec":"Nutrition, Diet & Food Safety 營養、飲食與食品安全","lab":"A158","t":"食品安全"},{"w":"food inspector","pos":"n.","def":"an official who checks that food and restaurants are safe","cn":"食品稽查員","s":"A ________ visited the night market last week, and two stalls were fined because their kitchens were dirty.","zh":"上週一名食品稽查員到夜市檢查，而有兩個攤位因為廚房骯髒而被罰款。","part":"A","sec":"Nutrition, Diet & Food Safety 營養、飲食與食品安全","lab":"A159","t":"食品稽查員"},{"w":"nutrition label","pos":"n.","def":"information on a food package about its nutrients","cn":"營養標示","s":"Check the ________ on the back of the box, and you will see how much sugar is hidden in this healthy-looking cereal.","zh":"看看盒子背面的營養標示，你就會發現這款看起來很健康的穀片裡藏了多少糖。","part":"A","sec":"Nutrition, Diet & Food Safety 營養、飲食與食品安全","lab":"A160","t":"營養標示"},{"w":"allergen","pos":"n.","def":"a substance that causes an allergic reaction","cn":"過敏原","s":"Peanuts are a common ________, so restaurants must tell customers if any dish contains them.","zh":"花生是常見的過敏原，所以餐廳必須告知顧客是否有任何菜餚含有花生。","part":"A","sec":"Nutrition, Diet & Food Safety 營養、飲食與食品安全","lab":"A161","t":"過敏原"},{"w":"gluten-free","pos":"adj.","def":"not containing gluten, a protein found in wheat","cn":"無麩質的","s":"The bakery started selling ________ bread last year, and it quickly became popular with customers who cannot eat wheat.","zh":"這家麵包店去年開始販售無麩質麵包，而且很快就受到不能吃小麥的顧客歡迎。","part":"A","sec":"Nutrition, Diet & Food Safety 營養、飲食與食品安全","lab":"A162","t":"無麩質"},{"w":"vegan","pos":"n.","def":"a person who eats no animal products at all","cn":"純素食者","s":"My cousin became a ________ last year, so she no longer eats meat, eggs or milk, but she still loves cooking for her friends.","zh":"我表妹去年成為純素食者，所以她不再吃肉、蛋或牛奶，但她仍然很喜歡為朋友下廚。","part":"A","sec":"Nutrition, Diet & Food Safety 營養、飲食與食品安全","lab":"A163","t":"純素食者"},{"w":"vegetarian","pos":"n.","def":"a person who does not eat meat or fish","cn":"素食者","s":"Taiwan is an easy place for a ________ to travel, because there are vegetarian restaurants in almost every neighbourhood.","zh":"台灣對素食者來說是很容易旅行的地方，因為幾乎每個社區都有素食餐廳。","part":"A","sec":"Nutrition, Diet & Food Safety 營養、飲食與食品安全","lab":"A164","t":"素食者"},{"w":"wholegrain","pos":"adj.","def":"made with the whole seed of the grain, including the outer layer","cn":"全穀的","s":"________ bread is healthier than white bread, but my little brother refuses to eat it because he says it tastes like cardboard.","zh":"全穀麵包比白麵包健康，但我弟弟拒絕吃，因為他說吃起來像紙板。","part":"A","sec":"Nutrition, Diet & Food Safety 營養、飲食與食品安全","lab":"A165","t":"全穀"},{"w":"junk food","pos":"n.","def":"food that is tasty but unhealthy","cn":"垃圾食物","s":"I try not to eat ________ before exams, but chips and chocolate are hard to resist when I study late.","zh":"我考試前盡量不吃垃圾食物，但熬夜讀書時，洋芋片和巧克力實在很難抗拒。","part":"A","sec":"Nutrition, Diet & Food Safety 營養、飲食與食品安全","lab":"A166","t":"垃圾食物"},{"w":"serving size","pos":"n.","def":"the amount of food that counts as one portion on a label","cn":"每份份量","s":"The ________ on the snack bag is only ten chips, but most people eat the whole bag in one go.","zh":"零食袋上標示的每份份量只有十片洋芋片，但大多數人一口氣就吃掉整包。","part":"A","sec":"Nutrition, Diet & Food Safety 營養、飲食與食品安全","lab":"A167","t":"每份份量"},{"w":"undercooked","pos":"adj.","def":"not cooked long enough","cn":"未煮熟的","s":"The chicken was ________ in the middle, so we sent it back to the kitchen because we did not want to get sick.","zh":"雞肉中間沒有煮熟，所以我們把它退回廚房，因為我們不想生病。","part":"A","sec":"Nutrition, Diet & Food Safety 營養、飲食與食品安全","lab":"A168","t":"沒有煮熟"},{"w":"food handler","pos":"n.","def":"a person whose job involves preparing or serving food","cn":"食品從業人員","s":"Every ________ must wear gloves and a hat, and they need a health check before they start working in the kitchen.","zh":"每位食品從業人員都必須戴手套和帽子，而且他們在進廚房工作前需要接受健康檢查。","part":"A","sec":"Nutrition, Diet & Food Safety 營養、飲食與食品安全","lab":"A169","t":"食品從業人員"},{"w":"digest","pos":"v.","def":"to break down food in the stomach so the body can use it","cn":"消化","s":"Some adults cannot ________ milk easily, so they feel uncomfortable after drinking a latte, but they can still eat cheese.","zh":"有些成人不容易消化牛奶，所以喝完拿鐵後會不舒服，但他們仍然可以吃起司。","part":"A","sec":"Nutrition, Diet & Food Safety 營養、飲食與食品安全","lab":"A170","t":"消化"},{"w":"sugary","pos":"adj.","def":"containing a lot of sugar","cn":"含糖量高的；含糖的","s":"The government wants to tax ________ drinks, because they are a major cause of tooth decay and weight problems among children.","zh":"政府想對含糖飲料課稅，因為它們是兒童蛀牙和體重問題的主要原因。","part":"A","sec":"Nutrition, Diet & Food Safety 營養、飲食與食品安全","lab":"A171","t":"含糖"},{"w":"dietary","pos":"adj.","def":"connected with the food people eat","cn":"飲食的","s":"The hotel asks every guest about their ________ needs, so the chef can prepare meals without nuts, meat or wheat.","zh":"這家飯店會詢問每位客人的飲食需求，所以主廚可以準備不含堅果、肉或小麥的餐點。","part":"A","sec":"Nutrition, Diet & Food Safety 營養、飲食與食品安全","lab":"A172","t":"飲食"},{"w":"food supply","pos":"n.","def":"the amount of food available to a population","cn":"糧食供應","s":"The war cut off the city's ________, so prices rose quickly and many families could only afford one meal a day.","zh":"戰爭切斷了這座城市的糧食供應，所以物價迅速上漲，許多家庭一天只吃得起一餐。","part":"A","sec":"Food Supply, Trade & Waste 糧食供應、貿易與浪費","lab":"A173","t":"糧食供應"},{"w":"food shortage","pos":"n.","def":"a situation in which there is not enough food","cn":"糧食短缺","s":"The drought caused a serious ________ in the region, and international groups sent rice and flour to help.","zh":"乾旱在該地區造成嚴重的糧食短缺，而國際組織送來了稻米和麵粉協助。","part":"A","sec":"Food Supply, Trade & Waste 糧食供應、貿易與浪費","lab":"A174","t":"糧食短缺"},{"w":"hunger","pos":"n.","def":"the state of not having enough food to eat","cn":"飢餓","s":"Millions of people still suffer from ________ every day, although the world produces enough food for everyone.","zh":"每天仍有數百萬人遭受飢餓之苦，儘管全世界生產的糧食足夠每個人吃。","part":"A","sec":"Food Supply, Trade & Waste 糧食供應、貿易與浪費","lab":"A175","t":"飢餓"},{"w":"grocery","pos":"n.","def":"food and other goods sold in a shop","cn":"食品雜貨","s":"We do our ________ shopping on Sunday mornings, because the market is less crowded and the vegetables are fresh.","zh":"我們都在星期天早上採買食品雜貨，因為市場人比較少，而且蔬菜很新鮮。","part":"A","sec":"Food Supply, Trade & Waste 糧食供應、貿易與浪費","lab":"A176","t":"食品雜貨"},{"w":"supermarket","pos":"n.","def":"a large shop that sells food and household goods","cn":"超市","s":"The ________ near my home sells vegetables from local farms, and the farmers' names and photos are printed on the packets.","zh":"我家附近的超市販售本地農場的蔬菜，而且包裝上印著農民的名字和照片。","part":"A","sec":"Food Supply, Trade & Waste 糧食供應、貿易與浪費","lab":"A177","t":"超市"},{"w":"wholesaler","pos":"n.","def":"a business that sells large amounts of goods to shops","cn":"批發商","s":"Farmers sell their cabbages to a ________, and he then sells them to restaurants and markets around the city.","zh":"農民把高麗菜賣給一位批發商，然後他再把它們賣給市區各地的餐廳和市場。","part":"A","sec":"Food Supply, Trade & Waste 糧食供應、貿易與浪費","lab":"A178","t":"批發商"},{"w":"middleman","pos":"n.","def":"a person who buys from producers and sells to shops or customers","cn":"中間商；中盤商","s":"Farmers often earn very little because the ________ takes a large share of the profit, so some now sell directly online.","zh":"農民常常賺得很少，因為中間商拿走大部分利潤，所以現在有些人直接在網路上販售。","part":"A","sec":"Food Supply, Trade & Waste 糧食供應、貿易與浪費","lab":"A179","t":"中間商"},{"w":"farmers' market","pos":"n.","def":"a market where farmers sell their own produce directly","cn":"農夫市集","s":"Every Saturday there is a ________ near the park, and you can talk to the people who actually grew your vegetables.","zh":"每週六公園附近都有農夫市集，而且你可以和親手種出你蔬菜的人聊天。","part":"A","sec":"Food Supply, Trade & Waste 糧食供應、貿易與浪費","lab":"A180","t":"農夫市集"},{"w":"produce","pos":"n.","def":"fruit and vegetables grown for sale","cn":"農產品","s":"Fresh ________ from the mountains arrives at the market early in the morning, so chefs go there before sunrise to choose the best.","zh":"來自山區的新鮮農產品一大早就送到市場，所以廚師們在日出前就去挑選最好的。","part":"A","sec":"Food Supply, Trade & Waste 糧食供應、貿易與浪費","lab":"A181","t":"農產品"},{"w":"food miles","pos":"n.","def":"the distance food travels from where it is grown to where it is eaten","cn":"食物里程","s":"Buying local fruit reduces ________, because it does not have to be flown across the world before it reaches your table.","zh":"購買本地水果能減少食物里程，因為它不必飛越半個地球才送上你的餐桌。","part":"A","sec":"Food Supply, Trade & Waste 糧食供應、貿易與浪費","lab":"A182","t":"食物里程"},{"w":"fair trade","pos":"n.","def":"a system that pays farmers in poor countries a fair price","cn":"公平貿易","s":"This coffee is sold under ________, so the farmers in Africa receive a fair price and can send their children to school.","zh":"這款咖啡以公平貿易方式販售，所以非洲的農民能得到合理的價格，並送孩子上學。","part":"A","sec":"Food Supply, Trade & Waste 糧食供應、貿易與浪費","lab":"A183","t":"公平貿易"},{"w":"rationing","pos":"n.","def":"limiting the amount of food each person may have","cn":"配給（制度）","s":"During the war, food ________ meant that each family could buy only a little sugar and meat each week.","zh":"戰爭期間，糧食配給代表每個家庭每週只能買一點點糖和肉。","part":"A","sec":"Food Supply, Trade & Waste 糧食供應、貿易與浪費","lab":"A184","t":"配給"},{"w":"food bank","pos":"n.","def":"a place that gives free food to people in need","cn":"食物銀行","s":"Our class collected canned food for the local ________, and the volunteers gave it to families who could not afford groceries.","zh":"我們班為當地的食物銀行收集罐頭食品，而志工把它們送給買不起食物的家庭。","part":"A","sec":"Food Supply, Trade & Waste 糧食供應、貿易與浪費","lab":"A185","t":"食物銀行"},{"w":"food waste","pos":"n.","def":"food that is thrown away instead of eaten","cn":"食物浪費；廚餘","s":"Restaurants produce a lot of ________ every night, so some now give unsold bread to charities instead of throwing it away.","zh":"餐廳每晚都產生大量廚餘，所以現在有些餐廳把沒賣完的麵包捐給慈善機構，而不是丟掉。","part":"A","sec":"Food Supply, Trade & Waste 糧食供應、貿易與浪費","lab":"A186","t":"廚餘"},{"w":"leftovers","pos":"n.","def":"food that remains after a meal","cn":"剩菜","s":"We often eat the ________ from Sunday dinner for lunch on Monday, so nothing goes to waste in our house.","zh":"我們常把星期天晚餐的剩菜當作星期一的午餐，所以我們家沒有東西會浪費。","part":"A","sec":"Food Supply, Trade & Waste 糧食供應、貿易與浪費","lab":"A187","t":"剩菜"},{"w":"imperfect","pos":"adj.","def":"(of fruit or vegetables) not perfect in shape or appearance","cn":"不完美的；賣相不佳的","s":"The supermarket sells ________ carrots at half price, and customers have discovered that they taste just as good.","zh":"這家超市以半價販售賣相不佳的紅蘿蔔，而顧客們發現它們吃起來一樣美味。","part":"A","sec":"Food Supply, Trade & Waste 糧食供應、貿易與浪費","lab":"A188","t":"賣相不佳的"},{"w":"food aid","pos":"n.","def":"food given to countries or people in need","cn":"糧食援助","s":"After the earthquake, ________ arrived from many countries, but the broken roads made it hard to reach mountain villages.","zh":"地震後，來自許多國家的糧食援助抵達了，但損毀的道路讓物資很難送到山區村莊。","part":"A","sec":"Food Supply, Trade & Waste 糧食供應、貿易與浪費","lab":"A189","t":"糧食援助"},{"w":"grain reserve","pos":"n.","def":"a store of grain kept for emergencies","cn":"儲備糧","s":"The government keeps a large ________ of rice, so prices stay stable even when typhoons destroy part of the harvest.","zh":"政府保有大量的稻米儲備糧，所以即使颱風摧毀部分收成，價格也能保持穩定。","part":"A","sec":"Food Supply, Trade & Waste 糧食供應、貿易與浪費","lab":"A190","t":"儲備糧"},{"w":"crop insurance","pos":"n.","def":"insurance that pays farmers if their harvest is damaged","cn":"農作物保險","s":"My uncle bought ________ for his banana farm, and it paid for most of his losses when the typhoon hit.","zh":"我叔叔為他的香蕉園買了農作物保險，而颱風來襲時，它賠償了他大部分的損失。","part":"A","sec":"Food Supply, Trade & Waste 糧食供應、貿易與浪費","lab":"A191","t":"農作物保險"},{"w":"agribusiness","pos":"n.","def":"farming run as a large industry","cn":"農業企業；農產綜合企業","s":"Large ________ companies control much of the world's seed market, so small farmers often worry about rising prices.","zh":"大型農業企業控制了全球大部分的種子市場，所以小農常擔心價格上漲。","part":"A","sec":"Food Supply, Trade & Waste 糧食供應、貿易與浪費","lab":"A192","t":"農業企業"},{"w":"distributor","pos":"n.","def":"a company that delivers goods from producers to shops","cn":"經銷商","s":"The milk ________ delivers to over two hundred stores every morning, so his trucks leave the factory before dawn.","zh":"這家牛奶經銷商每天早上配送到兩百多家商店，所以他的貨車天亮前就離開工廠。","part":"A","sec":"Food Supply, Trade & Waste 糧食供應、貿易與浪費","lab":"A193","t":"經銷商"},{"w":"refrigerated truck","pos":"n.","def":"a truck with a cooling system for carrying fresh food","cn":"冷藏車","s":"The fish is carried in a ________ from the port to Taipei, and the temperature inside is checked throughout the journey.","zh":"魚貨用冷藏車從港口運到台北，而且一路上都會檢查車內的溫度。","part":"A","sec":"Food Supply, Trade & Waste 糧食供應、貿易與浪費","lab":"A194","t":"冷藏車"},{"w":"cold storage","pos":"n.","def":"keeping food in a cold place so it stays fresh","cn":"冷藏庫；冷藏儲存","s":"Apples can be kept in ________ for many months, so we can buy them all year, although they are picked only in autumn.","zh":"蘋果可以在冷藏庫裡保存好幾個月，所以儘管只在秋天採收，我們卻能全年買到。","part":"A","sec":"Food Supply, Trade & Waste 糧食供應、貿易與浪費","lab":"A195","t":"冷藏庫"},{"w":"price hike","pos":"n.","def":"a sudden large increase in price","cn":"漲價","s":"After the typhoon there was a big ________ for vegetables, so many families ate more tofu and eggs that week.","zh":"颱風過後蔬菜大幅漲價，所以那週許多家庭都多吃豆腐和雞蛋。","part":"A","sec":"Food Supply, Trade & Waste 糧食供應、貿易與浪費","lab":"A196","t":"漲價"},{"w":"bulk buying","pos":"n.","def":"buying large amounts at one time, usually at a lower price","cn":"大量採購","s":"________ can save money for big families, but food may go bad if you buy more than you can eat.","zh":"大量採購可以為大家庭省錢，但如果你買的比吃得完的還多，食物就可能壞掉。","part":"A","sec":"Food Supply, Trade & Waste 糧食供應、貿易與浪費","lab":"A197","t":"大量採購"},{"w":"retailer","pos":"n.","def":"a business that sells goods directly to the public","cn":"零售商","s":"The ________ promised to stop selling eggs from caged hens by 2030, and other shops soon made the same promise.","zh":"這家零售商承諾在2030年前停止販售籠飼雞蛋，而其他商店很快也做出了同樣的承諾。","part":"A","sec":"Food Supply, Trade & Waste 糧食供應、貿易與浪費","lab":"A198","t":"零售商"},{"w":"food scraps","pos":"n.","def":"small pieces of leftover food that are thrown away","cn":"廚餘碎屑","s":"In Taipei we put ________ in a special bin, and the city turns them into pig feed or fertiliser.","zh":"在台北我們把廚餘放進專用的桶子，而市政府會把它們變成豬飼料或肥料。","part":"A","sec":"Food Supply, Trade & Waste 糧食供應、貿易與浪費","lab":"A199","t":"廚餘"},{"w":"doggy bag","pos":"n.","def":"a bag or box for taking home food you did not finish at a restaurant","cn":"打包袋（剩菜外帶）","s":"We could not finish the huge pizza, so we asked the waiter for a ________ and took the rest home for breakfast.","zh":"我們吃不完那個超大披薩，所以我們跟服務生要了打包袋，把剩下的帶回家當早餐。","part":"A","sec":"Food Supply, Trade & Waste 糧食供應、貿易與浪費","lab":"A200","t":"打包袋"},{"w":"acclimatise","pos":"v.","def":"to get used to a new climate or situation","cn":"適應（新環境）","s":"The new rice variety needed two seasons to ________ to the cooler mountain weather, but now it grows as well as it does on the plains.","zh":"這個新稻種花了兩季才適應較涼的山區天氣，但現在它長得跟在平原上一樣好。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B1","t":"適應"},{"w":"adulterate","pos":"v.","def":"to make food worse by adding cheaper or harmful things","cn":"摻假；摻雜","s":"Some dishonest companies ________ honey with cheap sugar syrup, so experts test samples in the lab before they reach shops.","zh":"有些不肖公司用便宜的糖漿摻假蜂蜜，所以專家會在樣品進入商店前先在實驗室檢驗。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B2","t":"摻假"},{"w":"affordability","pos":"n.","def":"how cheap enough something is for people to buy","cn":"可負擔性","s":"The ________ of fresh vegetables has become a problem since the typhoon, and many families now buy frozen ones instead.","zh":"颱風過後，新鮮蔬菜的可負擔性成了問題，而許多家庭現在改買冷凍蔬菜。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B3","t":"可負擔性"},{"w":"allure","pos":"n.","def":"the attractive or exciting quality of something","cn":"吸引力；魅力","s":"The ________ of city jobs draws young people away from farming villages, so many fields are now looked after by elderly farmers.","zh":"城市工作的吸引力讓年輕人離開農村，所以現在許多田地都由年長的農民照料。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B4","t":"吸引力"},{"w":"ambiguity","pos":"n.","def":"the state of having more than one possible meaning","cn":"模稜兩可；含糊","s":"There is some ________ in the word 'natural' on food labels, so shoppers may think a product is healthier than it really is.","zh":"食品標籤上「天然」這個詞有些模稜兩可，所以消費者可能以為產品比實際更健康。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B5","t":"模稜兩可"},{"w":"annihilate","pos":"v.","def":"to destroy something completely","cn":"徹底摧毀；殲滅","s":"A swarm of locusts can ________ a whole field of wheat in a single day, and farmers can do almost nothing to stop it.","zh":"一大群蝗蟲能在一天之內徹底摧毀整片麥田，而農民幾乎束手無策。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B6","t":"徹底摧毀"},{"w":"anomalous","pos":"adj.","def":"different from what is normal or expected","cn":"異常的；反常的","s":"The scientists found ________ levels of chemicals in the river near the farm, so they took more samples to check the results.","zh":"科學家在農場附近的河流中發現異常的化學物質含量，所以他們採集更多樣本來確認結果。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B7","t":"異常的"},{"w":"antidote","pos":"n.","def":"something that reduces the bad effects of another thing","cn":"解藥；矯正方法","s":"Home cooking can be an ________ to fast-food culture, and it also gives families a chance to talk at the dinner table.","zh":"在家做飯可以是速食文化的解藥，而且它也讓家人有機會在餐桌上聊天。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B8","t":"解藥"},{"w":"apportion","pos":"v.","def":"to divide something and share it out","cn":"分配；分攤","s":"The village committee had to ________ the limited water between the farms, but every farmer believed he deserved more.","zh":"村委會必須把有限的水分配給各個農場，但每位農民都認為自己應該分到更多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B9","t":"分配"},{"w":"aspiration","pos":"n.","def":"a strong hope to achieve something","cn":"抱負；志向","s":"Her ________ is to run an organic farm in Hualien, so she is studying soil science and saving money every month.","zh":"她的志向是在花蓮經營一座有機農場，所以她正在研讀土壤科學，並且每個月存錢。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B10","t":"志向"},{"w":"assimilate","pos":"v.","def":"to take in and fully understand information or ideas","cn":"吸收；理解","s":"Young farmers ________ new technology quickly, while older farmers often need more time and practical examples.","zh":"年輕農民很快就能吸收新科技，而年長的農民常需要更多時間和實際例子。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B11","t":"吸收"},{"w":"astounding","pos":"adj.","def":"very surprising or shocking","cn":"令人震驚的；驚人的","s":"The amount of food wasted every year is ________, and one third of all food never reaches anyone's mouth.","zh":"每年浪費的食物量驚人，而所有食物中有三分之一從來沒有被吃進任何人的嘴裡。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B12","t":"驚人"},{"w":"attainable","pos":"adj.","def":"possible to achieve","cn":"可達成的","s":"The goal of halving food waste is ________, but only if shops, restaurants and families all change their habits.","zh":"將食物浪費減半的目標是可以達成的，但前提是商店、餐廳和家庭都要改變習慣。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B13","t":"可以達成的"},{"w":"austerity","pos":"n.","def":"a situation in which people have less money and must spend carefully","cn":"撙節；緊縮","s":"During the years of ________, many families grew vegetables in their gardens, and they rarely ate in restaurants.","zh":"在撙節的那些年，許多家庭在院子裡種菜，而且他們很少上館子吃飯。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B14","t":"撙節"},{"w":"authenticity","pos":"n.","def":"the quality of being real or true","cn":"真實性；道地","s":"Customers question the ________ of 'local' honey that is sold so cheaply, and some samples turned out to be imported.","zh":"顧客質疑那些賣得如此便宜的「本地」蜂蜜的真實性，而有些樣本後來證實是進口的。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B15","t":"真實性"},{"w":"averse","pos":"adj.","def":"strongly disliking or not wanting something","cn":"反對的；不願意的","s":"Many older farmers are ________ to taking risks, so they keep growing the same crops that their parents grew.","zh":"許多年長的農民不願意冒險，所以他們繼續種植父母那一代所種的作物。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B16","t":"不願意"},{"w":"backbone","pos":"n.","def":"the most important part that supports a system","cn":"支柱；骨幹","s":"Small family farms are the ________ of the local economy, so the closing of even one farm affects the whole village.","zh":"小型家庭農場是當地經濟的支柱，所以即使只有一座農場關閉，也會影響整個村莊。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B17","t":"支柱"},{"w":"belated","pos":"adj.","def":"happening or coming later than it should","cn":"延遲的；遲來的","s":"The government made a ________ attempt to help the banana farmers, but by then many of them had already lost their land.","zh":"政府遲來地嘗試幫助香蕉農，但那時他們許多人已經失去了土地。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B18","t":"遲來地"},{"w":"beneficiary","pos":"n.","def":"a person who gets an advantage from something","cn":"受益者","s":"The main ________ of the new irrigation system was the village school, because it could finally grow its own vegetables.","zh":"新灌溉系統的主要受益者是村裡的學校，因為它終於能種自己的蔬菜了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B19","t":"受益者"},{"w":"bountiful","pos":"adj.","def":"in large amounts; plentiful","cn":"豐富的；大量的","s":"The rain came at the right time this year, so the harvest was ________ and the farmers held a big festival.","zh":"今年雨水來得正是時候，所以收成豐碩，而農民們舉辦了一場盛大的慶典。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B20","t":"豐碩"},{"w":"cascade","pos":"n.","def":"a series of things that happen one after another","cn":"一連串；連鎖","s":"The drought caused a ________ of problems, because crops failed, food prices rose and many workers lost their jobs.","zh":"乾旱引發了一連串的問題，因為作物歉收、糧價上漲，許多工人也失去了工作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B21","t":"一連串"},{"w":"catastrophe","pos":"n.","def":"a sudden event that causes great damage","cn":"大災難","s":"A failed rice harvest would be a ________ for the region, so scientists are working hard on flood-resistant seeds.","zh":"稻米歉收對這個地區會是一場大災難，所以科學家正努力研發耐洪水的種子。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B22","t":"大災難"},{"w":"cessation","pos":"n.","def":"the stopping of something","cn":"停止；中止","s":"The ________ of fighting allowed farmers to return to their fields, and food began to reach the markets again.","zh":"戰事的停止讓農民得以回到田裡，而食物也開始重新送到市場。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B23","t":"停止"},{"w":"clandestine","pos":"adj.","def":"secret and often illegal","cn":"祕密的；暗中的","s":"Police discovered a ________ factory that was making fake cooking oil, and it had been selling to night markets for years.","zh":"警方發現了一家祕密製造假食用油的工廠，而且它已經賣給夜市好幾年了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B24","t":"祕密"},{"w":"coarse","pos":"adj.","def":"rough and not fine or smooth","cn":"粗糙的；粗的","s":"The flour from the old stone mill is ________, but the bread has a rich taste, so tourists queue to buy it.","zh":"老石磨磨出的麵粉很粗，但做出的麵包風味濃郁，所以遊客都排隊購買。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B25","t":"粗"},{"w":"collateral","pos":"adj.","def":"happening as an extra, unplanned result of something","cn":"附帶的；間接的","s":"The chemicals killed the insects, but there was ________ damage to the bees, and the fruit trees produced less fruit.","zh":"化學藥劑殺死了害蟲，但也對蜜蜂造成附帶傷害，而果樹的結果量也減少了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B26","t":"附帶"},{"w":"compatibility","pos":"n.","def":"the ability to exist or work together without problems","cn":"相容性","s":"The farmer tested the ________ of the two plants, because some crops grow badly when they are planted side by side.","zh":"農夫測試了兩種植物的相容性，因為有些作物並排種植時會長得不好。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B27","t":"相容性"},{"w":"complementary","pos":"adj.","def":"adding something useful so that two things work well together","cn":"互補的","s":"Rice and beans have ________ proteins, so eating them together gives the body what it needs.","zh":"米和豆類的蛋白質是互補的，所以一起吃能提供身體所需的營養。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B28","t":"互補的"},{"w":"composite","pos":"adj.","def":"made of several different parts or materials","cn":"合成的；綜合的","s":"The report used a ________ score based on price, safety and taste, and the local brand came first.","zh":"這份報告採用以價格、安全和口味為基礎的綜合分數，而本地品牌拿下第一名。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B29","t":"綜合"},{"w":"concoct","pos":"v.","def":"to make something by mixing different things, often in a new way","cn":"調製；調配","s":"The chef likes to ________ new sauces from local fruit, and his mango chilli dip has become very popular.","zh":"這位主廚喜歡用本地水果調製新醬料，而他的芒果辣椒沾醬已經大受歡迎。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B30","t":"調製"},{"w":"confound","pos":"v.","def":"to confuse or surprise someone because it is unexpected","cn":"使困惑；使驚訝","s":"The tiny farm's huge harvest ________ the experts, because it used no chemicals at all.","zh":"這座小農場的大豐收讓專家們大感困惑，因為它完全沒有使用任何化學藥劑。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B31","t":"大感困惑"},{"w":"connoisseur","pos":"n.","def":"an expert who knows a lot about food, drink or art","cn":"鑑賞家；行家","s":"My uncle is a tea ________, and he can tell which mountain a tea comes from just by smelling it.","zh":"我叔叔是茶葉行家，而且他光聞味道就能說出茶來自哪座山。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B32","t":"行家"},{"w":"consignment","pos":"n.","def":"a quantity of goods sent to someone","cn":"一批貨物","s":"A ________ of mangoes was stopped at the border, because officials found insects inside some of the boxes.","zh":"一批芒果在邊境被攔下，因為官員在部分箱子裡發現了昆蟲。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B33","t":"一批"},{"w":"contaminant","pos":"n.","def":"a substance that makes something dirty or unsafe","cn":"污染物","s":"The lab found a dangerous ________ in the river water, so farmers were told not to use it for their crops.","zh":"實驗室在河水中發現了一種危險的污染物，所以農民被告知不要用它灌溉作物。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B34","t":"污染物"},{"w":"contrive","pos":"v.","def":"to manage to do something difficult, often by being clever","cn":"設法做到","s":"The family ________ to feed six children on a very small income, and the mother grew most of their vegetables herself.","zh":"這家人以很微薄的收入設法養活了六個孩子，而母親自己種了大部分的蔬菜。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B35","t":"設法"},{"w":"corollary","pos":"n.","def":"a natural result of something else","cn":"必然結果","s":"Cheaper food is one ________ of modern farming, but another is the loss of many small family farms.","zh":"更便宜的食物是現代農業的一個必然結果，但另一個結果則是許多小型家庭農場的消失。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B36","t":"必然結果"},{"w":"counterfeit","pos":"adj.","def":"made to look real in order to trick people","cn":"偽造的；仿冒的","s":"Police seized thousands of bottles of ________ wine, and the labels looked so real that shops had no idea.","zh":"警方查獲了數千瓶仿冒葡萄酒，而標籤看起來太逼真，連商店都毫不知情。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B37","t":"仿冒"},{"w":"debase","pos":"v.","def":"to reduce the quality or value of something","cn":"降低（品質或價值）","s":"Adding cheap oil would ________ the quality of the olive oil, so the brand checks every batch carefully.","zh":"添加便宜的油會降低橄欖油的品質，所以這個品牌仔細檢查每一批產品。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B38","t":"降低"},{"w":"deflate","pos":"v.","def":"to make someone lose confidence or hope","cn":"使洩氣","s":"The terrible harvest ________ the young farmer, but his neighbours encouraged him to try again the next year.","zh":"糟糕的收成讓這位年輕農夫很洩氣，但鄰居們鼓勵他明年再試一次。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B39","t":"很洩氣"},{"w":"delicacy","pos":"n.","def":"a rare or expensive food that is special to eat","cn":"佳餚；珍饈","s":"Mullet roe is a ________ in Taiwan, so families often give it as a gift during Lunar New Year.","zh":"烏魚子在台灣是一種珍饈，所以家家戶戶常在農曆新年時把它當作禮物送人。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B40","t":"珍饈"},{"w":"depletion","pos":"n.","def":"the reduction of something until little is left","cn":"耗盡；枯竭","s":"The ________ of groundwater is a serious issue in the south, and some land has sunk below sea level.","zh":"地下水枯竭是南部嚴重的問題，而有些土地已經下陷到海平面以下。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B41","t":"枯竭"},{"w":"deposit","pos":"n.","def":"a layer of something left by water or natural processes","cn":"沉積物；沉積層","s":"The river leaves a rich ________ of mud after each flood, so the farmland along its banks is very fertile.","zh":"每次洪水過後河流都會留下一層肥沃的泥沉積物，所以沿岸的農地非常肥沃。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B42","t":"沉積物"},{"w":"deregulation","pos":"n.","def":"the removal of government rules from an industry","cn":"解除管制；鬆綁","s":"The ________ of rice prices helped some farmers earn more, but others struggled because big companies paid them less.","zh":"米價鬆綁讓部分農民賺得更多，但其他人卻過得很辛苦，因為大公司付給他們的錢更少了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B43","t":"鬆綁"},{"w":"devour","pos":"v.","def":"to eat something quickly and hungrily","cn":"狼吞虎嚥；吞食","s":"The hungry caterpillars ________ the cabbage leaves overnight, so the farmer found only holes in the morning.","zh":"飢餓的毛毛蟲一夜之間吞食了高麗菜葉，所以農夫早上只看到滿是破洞。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B44","t":"吞食"},{"w":"discerning","pos":"adj.","def":"able to judge the quality of something well","cn":"有眼光的；有辨別力的","s":"________ shoppers check where their vegetables come from, and they are willing to pay more for local produce.","zh":"有眼光的消費者會查看蔬菜的產地，而且他們願意為本地農產品多付錢。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B45","t":"有眼光的"},{"w":"disincentive","pos":"n.","def":"something that makes people less willing to do something","cn":"抑制因素；阻礙","s":"Low prices are a ________ for young farmers, so few of them want to grow rice like their grandparents did.","zh":"低價是年輕農民的阻礙，所以他們之中很少人想像祖父母那樣種稻。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B46","t":"阻礙"},{"w":"dosage","pos":"n.","def":"the amount of a medicine or chemical given at one time","cn":"劑量","s":"The vet checked the ________ carefully before treating the cows, because too much medicine could end up in the milk.","zh":"獸醫在治療乳牛前仔細確認劑量，因為過多的藥物可能會殘留在牛奶裡。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B47","t":"劑量"},{"w":"ebb","pos":"v.","def":"to slowly become less or weaker","cn":"衰退；減弱","s":"Interest in the new diet began to ________ after a few months, and the shop stopped selling the special products.","zh":"對這種新飲食法的興趣在幾個月後開始減退，而商店也停止販售那些特殊產品。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B48","t":"減退"},{"w":"elasticity","pos":"n.","def":"how much demand changes when prices change","cn":"彈性","s":"Rice has low price ________, so people still buy it when it becomes more expensive, but they cut back on snacks.","zh":"米的價格彈性很低，所以即使變貴了人們仍會購買，但他們會減少吃零食。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B49","t":"彈性"},{"w":"embargo","pos":"n.","def":"an official ban on trade with another country","cn":"禁運","s":"The ________ on pork exports hurt farmers badly, so the government gave them money to survive.","zh":"豬肉出口禁運嚴重打擊了農民，所以政府發放補助金讓他們度過難關。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B50","t":"禁運"},{"w":"extraneous","pos":"adj.","def":"not connected to the main subject; unnecessary","cn":"無關的；外來的","s":"The recipe contains no ________ ingredients, and it uses only rice, water and a little salt.","zh":"這份食譜不含任何多餘的食材，而且只用米、水和一點點鹽。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B51","t":"多餘的"},{"w":"fathom","pos":"v.","def":"to understand something difficult","cn":"理解；看透","s":"Many city children cannot ________ how much work goes into growing rice, so the school takes them to a farm every year.","zh":"許多城市孩子無法理解種稻需要付出多少勞力，所以學校每年都帶他們去農場。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B52","t":"理解"},{"w":"fluctuation","pos":"n.","def":"a change up and down in amount or level","cn":"波動","s":"The ________ in vegetable prices is huge in Taiwan, because one typhoon can destroy crops across the whole island.","zh":"台灣菜價的波動很大，因為一個颱風就能摧毀全島的作物。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B53","t":"波動"},{"w":"fortuitous","pos":"adj.","def":"happening by lucky chance","cn":"幸運的；偶然的","s":"The discovery of the new tea flavour was ________, because insects bit the leaves and changed their taste.","zh":"這種新茶風味的發現是偶然的，因為昆蟲咬了葉子而改變了它們的味道。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B54","t":"偶然的"},{"w":"fruition","pos":"n.","def":"the point at which a plan becomes real","cn":"實現；成果","s":"Her dream of opening a farm cafe finally came to ________ last year, and it is now full of visitors every weekend.","zh":"她開農場咖啡館的夢想終於在去年實現，而現在每個週末都擠滿了遊客。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B55","t":"實現"},{"w":"glut","pos":"n.","def":"too much of something, more than is needed","cn":"過剩；供過於求","s":"There was a ________ of cabbages this winter, so prices fell sharply and some farmers left them to rot in the field.","zh":"今年冬天高麗菜供過於求，所以價格暴跌，有些農民乾脆讓它們爛在田裡。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B56","t":"供過於求"},{"w":"gratify","pos":"v.","def":"to please someone or satisfy a desire","cn":"使滿足；使高興","s":"It ________ the farmers to see children enjoying their fruit, and they invited the class to visit again next year.","zh":"看到孩子們享用他們的水果讓農民們很欣慰，而且他們邀請這個班級明年再來參觀。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B57","t":"很欣慰"},{"w":"hardy","pos":"adj.","def":"strong and able to survive difficult conditions","cn":"耐寒的；耐勞的","s":"Sweet potatoes are ________ plants, so they can grow in poor soil where rice would never survive.","zh":"地瓜是生命力強的植物，所以它們能在稻米絕對無法存活的貧瘠土壤中生長。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B58","t":"生命力強的"},{"w":"haul","pos":"n.","def":"an amount of something that has been caught or taken","cn":"捕獲量；收穫","s":"The fishermen came back with a huge ________ of squid, so the harbour market was busy all night.","zh":"漁夫們帶回了大量的魷魚漁獲，所以港口市場整晚都很熱鬧。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B59","t":"漁獲"},{"w":"hefty","pos":"adj.","def":"large in amount, especially money","cn":"高額的；大量的","s":"The restaurant received a ________ fine for using expired meat, and it lost many customers after the news spread.","zh":"這家餐廳因使用過期肉品而被處以高額罰款，而且消息傳開後失去了許多顧客。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B60","t":"高額"},{"w":"imperceptible","pos":"adj.","def":"too small to be noticed","cn":"察覺不到的；極細微的","s":"The change in taste was almost ________, but the company had cut the sugar by twenty percent.","zh":"口味的改變幾乎察覺不到，但公司已經把糖減少了百分之二十。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B61","t":"察覺不到"},{"w":"impervious","pos":"adj.","def":"not affected by something, or not letting water through","cn":"不受影響的；不透水的","s":"The new rice seems ________ to the disease, so farmers who planted it saved their whole harvest.","zh":"這種新稻米似乎不受這種病害影響，所以種植它的農民保住了整季的收成。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B62","t":"不受 影響"},{"w":"implausible","pos":"adj.","def":"difficult to believe","cn":"難以置信的","s":"The advert's claim that the tea can cure every illness is ________, so the government ordered the company to remove it.","zh":"廣告宣稱這款茶能治百病的說法令人難以置信，所以政府命令公司撤下廣告。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B63","t":"令人難以置信"},{"w":"incidental","pos":"adj.","def":"happening as a minor part of something else","cn":"附帶的；次要的","s":"Saving money was only an ________ benefit, because the main reason she grew vegetables was to relax after work.","zh":"省錢只是附帶的好處，因為她種菜的主要原因是下班後放鬆。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B64","t":"附帶的"},{"w":"incompatible","pos":"adj.","def":"not able to exist or work together","cn":"不相容的；互相抵觸的","s":"Cheap food and fair wages for farmers can seem ________, but fair trade shows that both are possible.","zh":"便宜的食物與農民的合理工資看似互相抵觸，但公平貿易證明兩者可以兼得。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B65","t":"互相抵觸"},{"w":"inconclusive","pos":"adj.","def":"not giving a clear result","cn":"無定論的；不確定的","s":"The study on coffee and health was ________, so scientists plan to follow more people for a longer time.","zh":"這項咖啡與健康的研究沒有定論，所以科學家計畫追蹤更多人更長的時間。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B66","t":"沒有定論"},{"w":"indulge","pos":"v.","def":"to allow yourself to enjoy something special","cn":"沉溺；放縱享受","s":"I ________ in a big slice of cake after my exams, but I usually try to avoid sweet food.","zh":"考完試後我會放縱自己吃一大塊蛋糕，但平常我盡量避免吃甜食。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B67","t":"放縱"},{"w":"inedible","pos":"adj.","def":"not fit or safe to eat","cn":"不能吃的","s":"Some wild mushrooms look delicious but are ________, so you should never pick them unless an expert is with you.","zh":"有些野生菇類看起來很美味，卻是不能吃的，所以除非有專家同行，否則你絕不該採摘。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B68","t":"不能吃的"},{"w":"inert","pos":"adj.","def":"not producing a chemical reaction","cn":"惰性的；無作用的","s":"The gas used in the snack bags is ________, so it keeps the chips fresh and does not change their taste.","zh":"零食袋裡使用的氣體是惰性的，所以它能保持洋芋片新鮮，又不會改變味道。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B69","t":"惰性的"},{"w":"infusion","pos":"n.","def":"a drink made by soaking leaves or fruit in hot water; or adding something new","cn":"浸泡液；注入","s":"The government's ________ of money into agritech has attracted young people, and several new start-ups have opened.","zh":"政府對農業科技的資金注入吸引了年輕人，而且已經有好幾家新創公司成立。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B70","t":"注入"},{"w":"innumerable","pos":"adj.","def":"too many to be counted","cn":"無數的","s":"There are ________ ways to cook tofu, so my grandmother never serves it the same way twice in a week.","zh":"豆腐有無數種料理方式，所以我奶奶一週內從不用同一種方式煮它。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B71","t":"無數"},{"w":"insolvent","pos":"adj.","def":"unable to pay debts","cn":"無力償債的；破產的","s":"Several pig farms became ________ after the disease outbreak, and the owners had to sell their land.","zh":"疫情爆發後，好幾座養豬場無力償債，而場主們只好賣掉土地。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B72","t":"無力償債"},{"w":"instantaneous","pos":"adj.","def":"happening immediately","cn":"瞬間的；即時的","s":"The effect of the new app was almost ________, because farmers could suddenly sell directly to customers.","zh":"這款新應用程式的效果幾乎是立竿見影的，因為農民突然間就能直接賣給顧客。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B73","t":"立竿見影的"},{"w":"intake","pos":"n.","def":"the amount of food or drink you take into your body","cn":"攝取量","s":"Doctors advise teenagers to reduce their sugar ________, because too much can harm their teeth and health.","zh":"醫生建議青少年減少糖的攝取量，因為攝取過多會傷害牙齒和健康。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B74","t":"攝取量"},{"w":"irreparable","pos":"adj.","def":"too bad to be repaired or put right","cn":"無法挽回的；不可修復的","s":"The chemical spill caused ________ damage to the farmland, so the owners could never grow crops there again.","zh":"化學物質外洩對農地造成無法挽回的損害，所以地主再也無法在那裡種植作物。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B75","t":"無法挽回的"},{"w":"judicious","pos":"adj.","def":"showing good judgement","cn":"明智的；審慎的","s":"With ________ use of water, the farm survived the drought, while neighbouring farms lost most of their crops.","zh":"透過審慎的用水，這座農場撐過了乾旱，而鄰近的農場卻損失了大部分的作物。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B76","t":"審慎的"},{"w":"leniency","pos":"n.","def":"the quality of being less strict than expected","cn":"寬大；從輕","s":"The court showed no ________ to the company that sold fake oil, and the owner was sent to prison.","zh":"法院對販售假油的公司毫不寬貸，而老闆被送進了監獄。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B77","t":"寬貸"},{"w":"misguided","pos":"adj.","def":"based on wrong ideas or judgement","cn":"被誤導的；錯誤的","s":"The idea that all fat is bad is ________, because our bodies need healthy fats from fish and nuts.","zh":"所有脂肪都不好的觀念是錯誤的，因為我們的身體需要從魚和堅果中攝取健康的脂肪。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B78","t":"錯誤的"},{"w":"mismanagement","pos":"n.","def":"bad or careless control of something","cn":"管理不當","s":"The water shortage was caused partly by ________, because old pipes leaked and nobody repaired them.","zh":"缺水的部分原因是管理不當，因為老舊的水管漏水卻沒有人修理。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B79","t":"管理不當"},{"w":"nourish","pos":"v.","def":"to give a living thing the food it needs to grow","cn":"滋養；養育","s":"Breast milk ________ babies in their first months, and it also protects them from many diseases.","zh":"母乳在嬰兒出生後的頭幾個月滋養他們，而且也保護他們免於許多疾病。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B80","t":"滋養"},{"w":"nourishment","pos":"n.","def":"food needed to live and grow","cn":"營養；食物","s":"The plants get ________ from the fish waste in the water, so the farmer does not need to add fertiliser.","zh":"植物從水中的魚排泄物獲得養分，所以農夫不需要添加肥料。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B81","t":"養分"},{"w":"noxious","pos":"adj.","def":"harmful or poisonous","cn":"有毒的；有害的","s":"The factory released ________ gases near the farms, and the farmers noticed brown spots on their vegetables.","zh":"工廠在農場附近排放了有毒氣體，而農民注意到他們的蔬菜上出現了褐色斑點。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B82","t":"有毒"},{"w":"obsolescence","pos":"n.","def":"the state of becoming old-fashioned and no longer used","cn":"過時；淘汰","s":"Hand tools are heading towards ________ on large farms, but many small farmers in the mountains still use them every day.","zh":"在大型農場上手工具正逐漸走向淘汰，但山區許多小農仍然每天使用它們。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B83","t":"淘汰"},{"w":"offshoot","pos":"n.","def":"something that develops from something larger","cn":"分支；衍生物","s":"The farm cafe began as an ________ of the family's fruit business, but now it earns more money than the orchard.","zh":"這間農場咖啡館起初只是家族水果事業的分支，但現在它賺的錢比果園還多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B84","t":"分支"},{"w":"opportune","pos":"adj.","def":"happening at a suitable time","cn":"適時的；恰好的","s":"The rain came at an ________ moment, because the rice plants needed water just as the dry season was starting.","zh":"雨來得正是時候，因為乾季剛開始時稻子正需要水。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B85","t":"正是時候"},{"w":"overabundance","pos":"n.","def":"too large an amount of something","cn":"過多；過剩","s":"An ________ of choice in supermarkets can confuse shoppers, so some stores now offer fewer brands.","zh":"超市選擇過多可能會讓消費者困惑，所以有些商店現在提供較少的品牌。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B86","t":"過多"},{"w":"overconsumption","pos":"n.","def":"using or eating too much of something","cn":"過度消費；過量攝取","s":"The ________ of meat in rich countries puts pressure on land and water, so experts suggest eating more beans.","zh":"富裕國家對肉類的過度消費對土地和水資源造成壓力，所以專家建議多吃豆類。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B87","t":"過度消費"},{"w":"overproduction","pos":"n.","def":"producing more of something than people need","cn":"生產過剩","s":"________ of milk caused prices to fall, so some farmers poured it away because they could not sell it.","zh":"牛奶生產過剩導致價格下跌，所以有些農民因為賣不出去而把牛奶倒掉。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B88","t":"生產過剩"},{"w":"overstate","pos":"v.","def":"to describe something as bigger or more important than it really is","cn":"誇大","s":"Food companies sometimes ________ the health benefits of their products, so you should read the label carefully.","zh":"食品公司有時會誇大產品的健康益處，所以你應該仔細閱讀標籤。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B89","t":"誇大"},{"w":"palatable","pos":"adj.","def":"pleasant enough to eat, or acceptable","cn":"可口的；可接受的","s":"The chef added herbs to make the vegetables more ________, and the children finally finished their plates.","zh":"主廚加了香草讓蔬菜更可口，而孩子們終於把盤子裡的東西吃完了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B90","t":"可口"},{"w":"pernicious","pos":"adj.","def":"having a harmful effect, especially slowly and secretly","cn":"有害的；惡性的","s":"Sugary drinks have a ________ effect on children's teeth, so the school has stopped selling them.","zh":"含糖飲料對兒童牙齒有有害的影響，所以學校已經停止販售。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B91","t":"有害的"},{"w":"pertain","pos":"v.","def":"to be connected with a particular subject","cn":"與……有關","s":"These rules ________ to all restaurants in the city, so even small noodle stalls must follow them.","zh":"這些規定適用於市內所有餐廳，所以即使是小麵攤也必須遵守。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B92","t":"適用於"},{"w":"potency","pos":"n.","def":"the strength of something, such as a drug or chemical","cn":"效力；強度","s":"The ________ of the pesticide was so high that it killed helpful insects too, so the farmer switched to a gentler product.","zh":"這種農藥的效力太強，連益蟲也一起殺死了，所以農夫改用較溫和的產品。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B93","t":"效力"},{"w":"precipitous","pos":"adj.","def":"sudden and very large (of a fall)","cn":"急遽的；陡峭的","s":"There was a ________ drop in banana prices last month, and many farmers lost money on every box they sold.","zh":"上個月香蕉價格急遽下跌，而許多農民每賣一箱都在賠錢。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B94","t":"急遽"},{"w":"predatory","pos":"adj.","def":"trying to take advantage of weaker people","cn":"掠奪性的；剝削的","s":"Some lenders use ________ practices with poor farmers, so the government offers low-interest loans instead.","zh":"有些放款人對貧窮農民採取掠奪性的手段，所以政府改為提供低利貸款。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B95","t":"掠奪性的"},{"w":"preponderance","pos":"n.","def":"a larger number or amount of one kind than others","cn":"多數；優勢","s":"There is a ________ of elderly workers on Taiwan's farms, so experts worry about who will grow food in the future.","zh":"台灣的農場上以年長工作者居多，所以專家擔心未來由誰來種植糧食。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B96","t":"居多"},{"w":"prevalent","pos":"adj.","def":"common or widespread at a particular time","cn":"普遍的；盛行的","s":"Eating breakfast outside is ________ in Taiwan, and there is a breakfast shop on almost every street corner.","zh":"在台灣外食早餐很普遍，而且幾乎每個街角都有一家早餐店。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B97","t":"普遍"},{"w":"procurement","pos":"n.","def":"the process of buying supplies for an organisation","cn":"採購","s":"The school changed its ________ rules, so it now buys rice and vegetables directly from farms in the county.","zh":"學校修改了採購規定，所以現在直接向縣內的農場購買米和蔬菜。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B98","t":"採購"},{"w":"prodigious","pos":"adj.","def":"very large or impressive","cn":"巨大的；驚人的","s":"The festival needs a ________ amount of rice, so the organisers order it from several farms months in advance.","zh":"這個節慶需要驚人的米量，所以主辦單位提前好幾個月向多座農場訂購。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B99","t":"驚人的"},{"w":"profusion","pos":"n.","def":"a very large amount of something","cn":"大量；豐富","s":"In spring the orchard is a ________ of white flowers, and bees come from miles around to visit them.","zh":"春天時果園開滿大量白花，而蜜蜂從好幾哩外飛來拜訪它們。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B100","t":"大量"},{"w":"prohibitive","pos":"adj.","def":"so expensive that people cannot afford it","cn":"高昂得令人卻步的","s":"The cost of a vertical farm is ________ for most small farmers, so only large companies can build one.","zh":"垂直農場的成本對大多數小農來說高得令人卻步，所以只有大公司蓋得起。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B101","t":"高得令人卻步"},{"w":"prominence","pos":"n.","def":"the state of being important or well known","cn":"顯著；重要地位","s":"Plant-based food has gained ________ in recent years, and even fast-food chains now offer vegetarian burgers.","zh":"近年來植物性食品逐漸取得重要地位，而且連速食連鎖店現在都提供素食漢堡。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B102","t":"重要地位"},{"w":"proprietary","pos":"adj.","def":"owned by a company and protected by law","cn":"專利的；專有的","s":"The company keeps its sauce recipe ________, so only three people in the factory know all the ingredients.","zh":"這家公司把醬料配方列為專有機密，所以工廠裡只有三個人知道全部的成分。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B103","t":"專有"},{"w":"prudence","pos":"n.","def":"careful and sensible judgement","cn":"審慎；謹慎","s":"Farmers show ________ by saving part of their seeds every year, so they can replant if a typhoon destroys the crop.","zh":"農民每年保留一部分種子，展現了他們的審慎，這樣如果颱風摧毀作物，他們就能重新播種。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B104","t":"審慎"},{"w":"reallocate","pos":"v.","def":"to give something to a different person or purpose","cn":"重新分配","s":"The government decided to ________ water from factories to farms during the drought, but factory owners were unhappy.","zh":"政府決定在乾旱期間把工廠的用水重新分配給農場，但工廠老闆們很不高興。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B105","t":"重新分配"},{"w":"reciprocity","pos":"n.","def":"exchanging things with others for mutual benefit","cn":"互惠","s":"Village life was based on ________, because neighbours helped each other at harvest time and shared food.","zh":"鄉村生活建立在互惠的基礎上，因為鄰居們在收成時互相幫忙並分享食物。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B106","t":"互惠"},{"w":"recuperate","pos":"v.","def":"to recover after an illness or a difficult time","cn":"恢復；復原","s":"The land needs a few years to ________ after the flood, so the farmers are growing grass there for now.","zh":"洪水過後，這塊土地需要幾年時間來恢復，所以農民目前在那裡種草。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B107","t":"恢復"},{"w":"redistribute","pos":"v.","def":"to share something out again in a different way","cn":"重新分配","s":"The app helps shops ________ unsold food to charities, so less bread and fruit end up in the bin.","zh":"這款應用程式幫助商店把沒賣完的食物重新分配給慈善機構，所以較少的麵包和水果最後被丟進垃圾桶。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B108","t":"重新分配"},{"w":"regress","pos":"v.","def":"to go back to an earlier, worse state","cn":"倒退；退步","s":"Without new young farmers, the village's farming could ________, and old fields could turn back into forest.","zh":"如果沒有新的年輕農民，村裡的農業可能會倒退，而老田也可能重新變回森林。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B109","t":"倒退"},{"w":"reliance","pos":"n.","def":"the state of depending on something","cn":"依賴","s":"Taiwan's ________ on imported wheat worries some experts, because a global crisis could suddenly cut supplies.","zh":"台灣對進口小麥的依賴讓一些專家擔憂，因為全球危機可能突然切斷供應。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B110","t":"依賴"},{"w":"residual","pos":"adj.","def":"remaining after most of something has gone","cn":"殘留的","s":"The lab found ________ pesticide on the vegetables, so the farmer was told to wait longer before harvesting.","zh":"實驗室在蔬菜上發現殘留的農藥，所以農夫被告知要等更久才能採收。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B111","t":"殘留的"},{"w":"satiate","pos":"v.","def":"to satisfy hunger completely","cn":"使飽足；使滿足","s":"A bowl of beef noodle soup can ________ even a very hungry student, and it costs less than a fast-food meal.","zh":"一碗牛肉麵就能讓即使非常餓的學生吃飽，而且比一份速食餐還便宜。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B112","t":"吃飽"},{"w":"savour","pos":"v.","def":"to enjoy the taste of food slowly","cn":"細細品嚐","s":"My grandfather likes to ________ his tea slowly, and he says that people today eat and drink far too quickly.","zh":"我爺爺喜歡慢慢地品味他的茶，而且他說現在的人吃喝都太快了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B113","t":"品味"},{"w":"scourge","pos":"n.","def":"something that causes great trouble or suffering","cn":"禍害；災難","s":"Locusts have been a ________ for farmers for thousands of years, and swarms still destroy crops in parts of Africa.","zh":"數千年來蝗蟲一直是農民的禍害，而在非洲部分地區，蝗群至今仍在摧毀作物。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B114","t":"禍害"},{"w":"seasonality","pos":"n.","def":"the way something changes with the seasons","cn":"季節性","s":"The ________ of fruit means that mangoes are cheap in summer, but you can hardly find them in winter.","zh":"水果的季節性意味著芒果在夏天很便宜，但冬天幾乎買不到。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B115","t":"季節性"},{"w":"self-sufficiency","pos":"n.","def":"the ability to produce everything you need yourself","cn":"自給自足","s":"Taiwan's food ________ rate is only about thirty percent, so the country imports most of its grain.","zh":"台灣的糧食自給率只有大約百分之三十，所以國家大部分的穀物都仰賴進口。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B116","t":"自給"},{"w":"sequester","pos":"v.","def":"to store or capture something, such as carbon, so it is kept away","cn":"封存；隔離","s":"Healthy soil can ________ carbon from the air, so better farming could help fight climate change.","zh":"健康的土壤能封存空氣中的碳，所以更好的耕作方式有助於對抗氣候變遷。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B117","t":"封存"},{"w":"shrewd","pos":"adj.","def":"clever at understanding situations and making good decisions","cn":"精明的","s":"The ________ farmer sold his crop before the price fell, and his neighbours wished they had done the same.","zh":"這位精明的農夫在價格下跌前就賣掉了作物，而他的鄰居們都希望自己也這麼做了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B118","t":"精明的"},{"w":"smother","pos":"v.","def":"to cover something completely so it cannot breathe or grow","cn":"覆蓋；悶死","s":"Thick weeds can ________ young plants, so farmers remove them before the seedlings lose their sunlight.","zh":"茂密的雜草會悶死幼小的植物，所以農民會在幼苗失去陽光前把它們清除。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B119","t":"悶死"},{"w":"sourcing","pos":"n.","def":"the process of finding where to get supplies","cn":"採購來源；貨源管理","s":"The restaurant is proud of its local ________, and every vegetable comes from farms less than fifty kilometres away.","zh":"這家餐廳以在地採購為傲，而且每一種蔬菜都來自五十公里內的農場。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B120","t":"採購"},{"w":"sparingly","pos":"adv.","def":"in small amounts; not much","cn":"節省地；少量地","s":"Use salt ________ when you cook for elderly people, because too much can raise their blood pressure.","zh":"為長者烹調時要少量使用鹽，因為太多可能會讓他們的血壓升高。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B121","t":"少量"},{"w":"stagnation","pos":"n.","def":"a state of no growth or change","cn":"停滯","s":"Farm incomes have been in ________ for years, so many young people choose office jobs in the city.","zh":"農業收入多年來一直處於停滯，所以許多年輕人選擇到城市從事辦公室工作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B122","t":"停滯"},{"w":"subsist","pos":"v.","def":"to manage to stay alive with very little food or money","cn":"勉強維生","s":"During the war, families had to ________ on sweet potatoes, and rice was a luxury for special days.","zh":"戰爭期間，家家戶戶只能靠地瓜勉強維生，而白米是特殊日子才吃得到的奢侈品。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B123","t":"勉強維生"},{"w":"substantive","pos":"adj.","def":"real, important and serious","cn":"實質的；重大的","s":"The new law brought ________ changes to food labels, so shoppers can now see clearly where ingredients come from.","zh":"新法為食品標示帶來了實質的改變，所以消費者現在能清楚看到成分的來源。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B124","t":"實質的"},{"w":"succulent","pos":"adj.","def":"juicy and delicious","cn":"多汁的","s":"The pineapples from Pingtung are sweet and ________, so they are sent as gifts to friends overseas.","zh":"屏東的鳳梨又甜又多汁，所以人們把它們當作禮物寄給海外的朋友。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B125","t":"多汁"},{"w":"suffice","pos":"v.","def":"to be enough","cn":"足夠","s":"A small fridge will ________ for one person, but a family of five needs a much larger one.","zh":"小冰箱對一個人來說就足夠了，但五口之家需要大得多的冰箱。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B126","t":"足夠"},{"w":"susceptibility","pos":"n.","def":"how easily something is affected or harmed","cn":"易感性；敏感度","s":"Bananas have a high ________ to disease, because almost all of them are genetically identical.","zh":"香蕉對病害的易感性很高，因為它們幾乎全都基因相同。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B127","t":"易感性"},{"w":"sustenance","pos":"n.","def":"food and drink that keeps someone alive","cn":"食物；營養來源","s":"For many poor families, rice is the main source of ________, so a rise in its price can cause real hunger.","zh":"對許多貧困家庭來說，米是主要的糧食來源，所以它的價格上漲可能會造成真正的飢餓。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B128","t":"糧食來源"},{"w":"symptomatic","pos":"adj.","def":"showing that a bigger problem exists","cn":"有代表性的；徵兆性的","s":"Empty fields are ________ of a deeper problem, because young people do not see a future in farming.","zh":"荒廢的田地反映出更深層的問題，因為年輕人看不到務農的未來。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B129","t":"反映出"},{"w":"tamper","pos":"v.","def":"to change something without permission, often to cause harm","cn":"竄改；亂動","s":"Someone tried to ________ with the labels on the milk cartons, so the shop removed them all from the shelves.","zh":"有人企圖竄改牛奶盒上的標籤，所以商店把它們全部從架上撤下。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B130","t":"竄改"},{"w":"tantamount","pos":"adj.","def":"equal in effect to something worse","cn":"等同於","s":"Selling expired meat to families is ________ to poisoning customers on purpose, so the punishment is very serious.","zh":"把過期肉品賣給家庭等同於故意毒害顧客，所以懲罰非常嚴厲。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B131","t":"等同於"},{"w":"tenable","pos":"adj.","def":"able to be defended or kept going","cn":"站得住腳的；可維持的","s":"Growing rice on such dry land is no longer ________, so the farmers are switching to crops that need less water.","zh":"在這麼乾燥的土地上種稻已經無法維持了，所以農民正改種需水量較少的作物。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B132","t":"無法維持"},{"w":"tolerable","pos":"adj.","def":"acceptable, though not very good","cn":"尚可的；可忍受的","s":"The food at the camp was ________, but everyone was so hungry after hiking that nobody complained.","zh":"營地的食物還過得去，但健行後大家都餓壞了，所以沒有人抱怨。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B133","t":"過得去"},{"w":"toxicity","pos":"n.","def":"how poisonous something is","cn":"毒性","s":"Scientists measured the ________ of the new pesticide, and they found it was too dangerous for fish in nearby rivers.","zh":"科學家測量了新農藥的毒性，而他們發現它對附近河流中的魚類太危險了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B134","t":"毒性"},{"w":"traceability","pos":"n.","def":"the ability to follow where a product came from","cn":"可追溯性；產銷履歷","s":"The QR code improves ________, so customers can see which farm grew their rice and when it was harvested.","zh":"這個QR碼提升了可追溯性，所以顧客能看到哪座農場種了他們的米，以及何時收割。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B135","t":"可追溯性"},{"w":"unfettered","pos":"adj.","def":"not limited by rules","cn":"不受限制的","s":"________ use of chemicals damaged the land for decades, so stricter rules were finally introduced.","zh":"不受限制地使用化學藥劑破壞了土地數十年，所以終於訂定了更嚴格的規定。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B136","t":"不受限制地"},{"w":"unsustainable","pos":"adj.","def":"not able to continue at the same level","cn":"不可持續的","s":"Pumping so much groundwater is ________, because the land is sinking and the wells are drying up.","zh":"抽取這麼多地下水是不可持續的，因為土地正在下陷，水井也在乾涸。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B137","t":"不可持續的"},{"w":"upsurge","pos":"n.","def":"a sudden increase","cn":"激增","s":"There has been an ________ in home gardening since the pandemic, and seed shops have sold out of many vegetables.","zh":"疫情以來居家園藝出現了激增，而種子店的許多蔬菜種子都已經賣光了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B138","t":"激增"},{"w":"vanguard","pos":"n.","def":"the leading position in developing new ideas","cn":"先鋒；前衛","s":"The Netherlands is in the ________ of greenhouse farming, so experts from many countries go there to learn.","zh":"荷蘭處於溫室農業的先鋒地位，所以許多國家的專家都去那裡學習。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B139","t":"先鋒"},{"w":"verifiable","pos":"adj.","def":"able to be checked and proved true","cn":"可驗證的","s":"The organic label must be based on ________ tests, so inspectors visit farms and take soil samples.","zh":"有機標章必須以可驗證的檢測為依據，所以稽查員會造訪農場並採集土壤樣本。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B140","t":"可驗證的"},{"w":"viability","pos":"n.","def":"the ability to work successfully","cn":"可行性；生存能力","s":"The bank questioned the ________ of the indoor farm, because electricity costs were so high.","zh":"銀行質疑這座室內農場的可行性，因為電費實在太高了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B141","t":"可行性"},{"w":"voracious","pos":"adj.","def":"eating or wanting a very large amount","cn":"貪吃的；狼吞虎嚥的","s":"Teenage boys often have ________ appetites, so their parents are surprised by how much rice they eat.","zh":"青春期男孩常常食量驚人，所以他們的父母對他們吃那麼多飯感到驚訝。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B142","t":"食量驚人"},{"w":"vulnerability","pos":"n.","def":"the state of being easily hurt or damaged","cn":"脆弱性","s":"The typhoon showed the ________ of the island's food supply, because vegetable prices doubled within days.","zh":"颱風顯示出這座島嶼糧食供應的脆弱性，因為蔬菜價格在幾天內就翻倍了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B143","t":"脆弱性"},{"w":"wean","pos":"v.","def":"to make someone stop depending on something","cn":"使戒除；使逐漸擺脫","s":"The campaign tries to ________ students off sugary drinks, so the school offers free cold water instead.","zh":"這項運動試圖讓學生戒掉含糖飲料，所以學校改為提供免費的冰開水。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B144","t":"戒掉"},{"w":"withhold / withheld / withheld","pos":"v.","def":"to refuse to give something","cn":"扣留；拒絕給予","s":"The supermarket ________ payment from the farm, because the vegetables arrived late and many were damaged.","zh":"超市扣留了對農場的付款，因為蔬菜送達得太晚，而且許多都已損壞。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B145","t":"扣留"},{"w":"zeal","pos":"n.","def":"great energy and enthusiasm","cn":"熱忱；熱情","s":"The young farmers worked with great ________, and they turned the empty fields into a thriving organic farm.","zh":"年輕農民們滿懷熱忱地工作，並把空地變成了一座欣欣向榮的有機農場。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B146","t":"熱忱"},{"w":"adjunct","pos":"n.","def":"something added to a more important thing","cn":"附屬物；輔助","s":"Vitamin pills should only be an ________ to a healthy diet, so doctors say you cannot live on pills alone.","zh":"維他命丸只應該作為健康飲食的輔助，所以醫生說你不能只靠藥丸過活。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B147","t":"輔助"},{"w":"ancillary","pos":"adj.","def":"providing extra help or support","cn":"輔助的；附屬的","s":"The farm earns ________ income from school visits, and this money helps when the harvest is poor.","zh":"這座農場從學校參訪中獲得附加收入，而這筆錢在收成不佳時很有幫助。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B148","t":"附加"},{"w":"attenuate","pos":"v.","def":"to make something weaker or less strong","cn":"減弱；削弱","s":"Trees planted around the fields can ________ strong winds, so the crops are less likely to be damaged.","zh":"在田地周圍種樹可以減弱強風，所以作物比較不容易受損。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B149","t":"減弱"},{"w":"auxiliary","pos":"adj.","def":"giving extra help or support","cn":"輔助的；備用的","s":"The farm installed an ________ generator, so the fridges keep working even when a typhoon cuts the power.","zh":"這座農場安裝了一台備用發電機，所以即使颱風造成停電，冰箱也能繼續運作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B150","t":"備用"},{"w":"bedrock","pos":"n.","def":"the basic idea or thing on which others are built","cn":"基礎；根本","s":"Trust is the ________ of the food business, so one safety scandal can ruin a famous brand.","zh":"信任是食品業的根本，所以一起食安醜聞就能毀掉一個知名品牌。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B151","t":"根本"},{"w":"counterbalance","pos":"v.","def":"to have an equal but opposite effect on something","cn":"抵銷；平衡","s":"Higher prices for organic food ________ the smaller harvests, so organic farmers can still earn a living.","zh":"有機食品較高的價格抵銷了較少的收成，所以有機農民仍能維持生計。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B152","t":"抵銷"},{"w":"counterintuitive","pos":"adj.","def":"the opposite of what you would expect","cn":"違反直覺的","s":"It seems ________, but leaving some weeds in the field can actually help crops, because they attract useful insects.","zh":"這似乎違反直覺，但在田裡留一些雜草其實對作物有幫助，因為它們能吸引益蟲。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B153","t":"違反直覺"},{"w":"cyclical","pos":"adj.","def":"happening in a repeated pattern","cn":"週期性的","s":"Pig prices are ________, so they rise for a few years and then fall when too many farmers start raising pigs.","zh":"豬價是週期性的，所以它們會上漲幾年，然後在太多農民開始養豬時下跌。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B154","t":"週期性的"},{"w":"deceptive","pos":"adj.","def":"making you believe something false","cn":"誤導的；欺騙的","s":"The packaging is ________, because the box is large but there are only a few cookies inside.","zh":"這個包裝很誤導人，因為盒子很大，裡面卻只有幾片餅乾。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B155","t":"誤導人"},{"w":"discretionary","pos":"adj.","def":"decided by a person's own choice","cn":"可自由支配的","s":"Families spend less on ________ items like snacks when food prices rise, but they still buy rice and eggs.","zh":"當食物價格上漲時，家庭會減少在零食等非必需品上的花費，但他們仍然會買米和蛋。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B156","t":"非必需"},{"w":"divisive","pos":"adj.","def":"causing strong disagreement between people","cn":"造成分歧的","s":"The import of American pork was a ________ issue in Taiwan, and people argued about it for months.","zh":"進口美國豬肉在台灣是個引發分歧的議題，而人們為此爭論了好幾個月。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B157","t":"引發分歧的"},{"w":"egregious","pos":"adj.","def":"extremely bad and obvious","cn":"極其惡劣的","s":"The restaurant's ________ hygiene failures, such as rats in the kitchen, shocked the inspectors, so it was closed down immediately.","zh":"這家餐廳極其惡劣的衛生缺失，例如廚房裡有老鼠，讓稽查員大為震驚，所以它被立即勒令停業。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B158","t":"極其惡劣的"},{"w":"enormity","pos":"n.","def":"the great size or seriousness of a problem","cn":"嚴重性；巨大","s":"The ________ of world hunger can feel overwhelming, but small actions like donating food still make a difference.","zh":"全球飢餓問題的嚴重性可能令人難以承受，但像捐贈食物這樣的小行動仍然能帶來改變。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B159","t":"嚴重性"},{"w":"entitlement","pos":"n.","def":"the right to have or receive something","cn":"應得的權利","s":"Many people believe that food is a basic ________ for every child, so free school lunches should be offered everywhere.","zh":"許多人認為食物是每個孩子的基本權利，所以應該在各地提供免費的學校午餐。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B160","t":"權利"},{"w":"escalation","pos":"n.","def":"a rapid increase in size or seriousness","cn":"升級；加劇","s":"The ________ of the trade war raised food prices, and ordinary families felt the effects at the supermarket.","zh":"貿易戰的升級推高了食品價格，而一般家庭在超市就能感受到影響。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B161","t":"升級"},{"w":"exclusion","pos":"n.","def":"the act of not allowing someone or something to take part","cn":"排除；排斥","s":"The ________ of small farmers from big supermarket contracts is unfair, so some shops are now changing their policy.","zh":"將小農排除在大型超市合約之外是不公平的，所以一些商店現在正在改變政策。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B162","t":"排除"},{"w":"feasibility","pos":"n.","def":"how possible or practical something is","cn":"可行性","s":"The team studied the ________ of growing coffee in Taiwan, and they found that some mountain areas were ideal.","zh":"這個團隊研究了在台灣種咖啡的可行性，而他們發現某些山區非常理想。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B163","t":"可行性"},{"w":"flagrant","pos":"adj.","def":"shocking and done openly","cn":"明目張膽的","s":"Selling dyed vegetables as organic is a ________ breach of the law, and the shop owner was heavily fined.","zh":"把染色蔬菜當作有機產品販售是明目張膽的違法行為，而店主被重罰。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B164","t":"明目張膽的"},{"w":"frugality","pos":"n.","def":"the habit of not wasting money or food","cn":"節儉","s":"My grandparents' ________ taught me not to waste rice, and I still finish every grain in my bowl.","zh":"祖父母的節儉教會我不要浪費米飯，而我到現在仍會吃完碗裡的每一粒米。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B165","t":"節儉"},{"w":"harbinger","pos":"n.","def":"a sign that something is going to happen","cn":"預兆；先兆","s":"The first plum flowers are a ________ of spring, so farmers start preparing their fields when they appear.","zh":"第一批梅花是春天的預兆，所以梅花一開，農民就開始整地。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B166","t":"預兆"},{"w":"homogenise","pos":"v.","def":"to make things the same or similar","cn":"使同質化","s":"Global fast-food chains may ________ eating habits, but local night markets keep traditional dishes alive.","zh":"全球速食連鎖店可能會讓飲食習慣同質化，但本地夜市讓傳統小吃得以延續。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B167","t":"同質化"},{"w":"immeasurable","pos":"adj.","def":"too large to be measured","cn":"無法衡量的；無限的","s":"The value of bees to farming is ________, because without them many fruits and nuts would disappear.","zh":"蜜蜂對農業的價值是無法衡量的，因為沒有牠們，許多水果和堅果就會消失。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B168","t":"無法衡量的"},{"w":"impediment","pos":"n.","def":"something that makes progress difficult","cn":"障礙；阻礙","s":"High land prices are a major ________ for young farmers, so the government now rents out public land cheaply.","zh":"高地價是年輕農民的一大障礙，所以政府現在以低價出租公有土地。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B169","t":"障礙"},{"w":"imperil","pos":"v.","def":"to put something in danger","cn":"危及","s":"Rising sea levels could ________ rice farming in coastal areas, so scientists are testing salt-tolerant varieties.","zh":"海平面上升可能危及沿海地區的稻作，所以科學家正在測試耐鹽品種。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B170","t":"危及"},{"w":"imprudent","pos":"adj.","def":"not wise or sensible","cn":"不智的；輕率的","s":"It would be ________ to plant all your fields with one crop, because a single disease could destroy everything.","zh":"把所有田地都種同一種作物是不明智的，因為單一病害就可能摧毀一切。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B171","t":"不明智的"},{"w":"inaccessible","pos":"adj.","def":"impossible or very difficult to reach","cn":"難以到達的；無法取得的","s":"The landslide left the mountain village ________, so helicopters had to drop food for the residents.","zh":"山崩讓這座山村無法進出，所以直升機必須為居民空投食物。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B172","t":"無法進出"},{"w":"inconsistency","pos":"n.","def":"the state of not being the same or regular","cn":"不一致","s":"Customers complained about the ________ of the coffee, because it tasted different every time they ordered it.","zh":"顧客抱怨咖啡的品質不一致，因為每次點的味道都不一樣。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B173","t":"不一致"},{"w":"indicative","pos":"adj.","def":"showing or suggesting something","cn":"表明的；暗示的","s":"Yellow leaves are often ________ of a lack of nutrients, so the farmer tested the soil immediately.","zh":"黃葉常表示缺乏養分，所以農夫立刻檢測了土壤。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B174","t":"表示"},{"w":"inequitable","pos":"adj.","def":"unfair because some people get more than others","cn":"不公平的","s":"The ________ sharing of profits means that coffee farmers earn very little, while cafes make a lot of money.","zh":"利潤不公平的分配意味著咖啡農賺得很少，而咖啡館卻賺了很多錢。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B175","t":"不公平的"},{"w":"inescapable","pos":"adj.","def":"impossible to avoid","cn":"不可避免的","s":"The conclusion is ________: we must waste less food, or there will not be enough for everyone by 2050.","zh":"結論是無可避免的：我們必須減少浪費食物，否則到2050年將不夠每個人吃。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B176","t":"無可避免的"},{"w":"inflationary","pos":"adj.","def":"causing prices to rise","cn":"通貨膨脹的","s":"The rise in oil prices had an ________ effect on food, because transport and fertiliser both became more expensive.","zh":"油價上漲對食品產生了通膨效應，因為運輸和肥料都變得更貴了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B177","t":"通膨"},{"w":"inordinate","pos":"adj.","def":"far more than is reasonable","cn":"過度的","s":"Some families spend an ________ amount of money on food delivery, but they could save a lot by cooking at home.","zh":"有些家庭在外送上花了過多的錢，但他們如果在家做飯就能省下很多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B178","t":"過多的"},{"w":"malpractice","pos":"n.","def":"careless or illegal behaviour by a professional","cn":"不當行為；瀆職","s":"The inspector was accused of ________, because he had accepted gifts from the factory he was checking.","zh":"這名稽查員被指控瀆職，因為他收受了他正在檢查的工廠所送的禮物。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B179","t":"瀆職"},{"w":"manifold","pos":"adj.","def":"many and of different kinds","cn":"多種多樣的","s":"The benefits of school gardens are ________, because children learn science, exercise and eat more vegetables.","zh":"學校菜園的好處多不勝數，因為孩子們能學習科學、運動，並且吃更多蔬菜。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B180","t":"多不勝數"},{"w":"methodology","pos":"n.","def":"the methods used in a study or activity","cn":"研究方法；方法論","s":"The researchers explained their ________ clearly, so other scientists could repeat the food-waste study in their own cities.","zh":"研究人員清楚地說明了他們的研究方法，所以其他科學家能在自己的城市重複這項食物浪費研究。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B181","t":"研究方法"},{"w":"minuscule","pos":"adj.","def":"extremely small","cn":"極小的","s":"The amount of pesticide found was ________, so experts said the vegetables were still safe to eat.","zh":"檢測出的農藥量極少，所以專家說這些蔬菜仍然可以安全食用。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B182","t":"極少"},{"w":"multitude","pos":"n.","def":"a very large number of things or people","cn":"大量；眾多","s":"The night market offers a ________ of snacks, so first-time visitors often do not know where to begin.","zh":"夜市提供眾多小吃，所以第一次來的遊客常常不知道該從哪裡開始。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B183","t":"眾多"},{"w":"objectionable","pos":"adj.","def":"unpleasant and likely to offend","cn":"令人反感的","s":"Neighbours found the smell from the pig farm ________, so they complained to the city council.","zh":"鄰居們覺得養豬場的氣味令人反感，所以他們向市議會投訴。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B184","t":"令人反感"},{"w":"omission","pos":"n.","def":"something that has been left out","cn":"遺漏；省略","s":"The ________ of peanuts from the ingredient list was dangerous, because a customer with an allergy became very ill.","zh":"成分表中遺漏花生是很危險的，因為一位過敏的顧客因此病得很嚴重。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B185","t":"遺漏"},{"w":"overreliance","pos":"n.","def":"depending too much on something","cn":"過度依賴","s":"________ on a single crop is risky, so the government encourages farmers to grow several different kinds.","zh":"過度依賴單一作物是有風險的，所以政府鼓勵農民種植好幾種不同的作物。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B186","t":"過度依賴"},{"w":"paradoxically","pos":"adv.","def":"in a way that seems strange because it is the opposite of what you expect","cn":"矛盾地；弔詭地","s":"________, some of the world's hungriest people are farmers, because they sell their best food to pay their debts.","zh":"弔詭的是，世界上最飢餓的一些人竟是農民，因為他們賣掉最好的食物來償還債務。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B187","t":"弔詭的是"},{"w":"partake / partook / partaken","pos":"v.","def":"to eat or drink something; to take part","cn":"吃喝；參與","s":"Guests are invited to ________ in the harvest meal, and everyone eats together at long tables in the field.","zh":"賓客受邀參與豐收餐會，而且大家在田裡的長桌一起用餐。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B188","t":"參與"},{"w":"precedence","pos":"n.","def":"the right to be considered more important","cn":"優先權","s":"Food safety must take ________ over profit, so the company destroyed the whole batch when one test failed.","zh":"食品安全必須優先於利潤，所以當一項檢驗不合格時，公司就銷毀了整批產品。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B189","t":"優先"},{"w":"recurrence","pos":"n.","def":"the act of happening again","cn":"再次發生；復發","s":"To prevent a ________ of the outbreak, the farm now disinfects every truck that enters.","zh":"為了防止疫情再次發生，這座農場現在會對每一輛進入的卡車消毒。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B190","t":"再次發生"},{"w":"refinement","pos":"n.","def":"a small change that improves something","cn":"改良；精煉","s":"After years of ________, the farmer's tea won first prize, and buyers came from Japan to order it.","zh":"經過多年的改良，這位農夫的茶贏得了首獎，而買家從日本前來訂購。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B191","t":"改良"},{"w":"rigour","pos":"n.","def":"great care and attention to detail","cn":"嚴謹","s":"The testing is done with great ________, so every batch of baby milk is checked several times.","zh":"檢驗以極度嚴謹的方式進行，所以每一批嬰兒奶粉都會經過多次檢查。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B192","t":"嚴謹"},{"w":"speculative","pos":"adj.","def":"based on guesses rather than facts","cn":"推測的；投機的","s":"Claims that insects will replace meat are still ________, because most people are not ready to eat them.","zh":"昆蟲將取代肉類的說法仍是推測，因為大多數人還沒準備好吃牠們。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B193","t":"推測"},{"w":"undeniable","pos":"adj.","def":"clearly true and impossible to doubt","cn":"不可否認的","s":"The link between sugary drinks and weight gain is ________, but many teenagers still drink them every day.","zh":"含糖飲料與體重增加之間的關聯是不可否認的，但許多青少年仍然每天喝。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B194","t":"不可否認的"},{"w":"undervalue","pos":"v.","def":"to think something is less important than it really is","cn":"低估；輕視","s":"Society tends to ________ the work of farmers, although we depend on them for every meal we eat.","zh":"社會往往低估農民的工作，儘管我們吃的每一餐都仰賴他們。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B195","t":"低估"},{"w":"unintended","pos":"adj.","def":"not planned or meant","cn":"非預期的","s":"The cheap plastic bags had an ________ result, because many of them ended up in rivers and the sea.","zh":"便宜的塑膠袋帶來了非預期的後果，因為許多袋子最後流入了河川和海洋。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B196","t":"非預期的"},{"w":"unregulated","pos":"adj.","def":"not controlled by laws or rules","cn":"未受管制的","s":"________ street stalls may sell unsafe food, so the city now gives licences only to stalls that pass inspections.","zh":"未受管制的路邊攤可能販售不安全的食物，所以市政府現在只發執照給通過檢查的攤位。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B197","t":"未受管制的"},{"w":"unwarranted","pos":"adj.","def":"not justified or necessary","cn":"不必要的；無根據的","s":"Some fears about frozen food are ________, because freezing keeps most vitamins and stops bacteria from growing.","zh":"有些對冷凍食品的擔憂是沒有根據的，因為冷凍能保留大部分維他命並阻止細菌生長。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B198","t":"沒有根據的"},{"w":"vigilance","pos":"n.","def":"careful attention to notice possible danger","cn":"警覺；警惕","s":"Farmers must show constant ________ during flu season, because one sick bird can spread disease to the whole farm.","zh":"禽流感季節期間農民必須時時保持警覺，因為一隻生病的鳥就能把疾病傳遍整座農場。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B199","t":"警覺"},{"w":"volatility","pos":"n.","def":"the quality of changing suddenly and unpredictably","cn":"不穩定；波動性","s":"Price ________ makes farming risky, so farmers who sign fixed-price contracts can sleep better at night.","zh":"價格波動讓務農充滿風險，所以簽訂固定價格合約的農民晚上能睡得比較安穩。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B200","t":"波動"},{"w":"from farm to table","pos":"phr.","def":"directly from where food is grown to where it is eaten","cn":"從產地到餐桌","s":"The restaurant follows the idea of ______ ______ ______ ______, so the vegetables you eat at lunch were picked that morning.","zh":"這家餐廳遵循從產地到餐桌的理念，所以你午餐吃到的蔬菜是當天早上才採收的。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P1","t":"從產地到餐桌"},{"w":"put food on the table","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to earn enough money to feed your family","cn":"養家糊口","s":"My father works two jobs to ______ ______ ______ ______ ______, but he still finds time to help me with homework.","zh":"我爸爸做兩份工作來養家糊口，但他仍會抽空幫我寫功課。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P2","t":"養家糊口"},{"w":"bring home the bacon","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to earn money to support a family","cn":"賺錢養家","s":"In my family, both of my parents ______ ______ ______ ______, so we all share the housework at weekends.","zh":"在我們家，爸媽兩個人都賺錢養家，所以週末我們全家一起分擔家事。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P3","t":"賺錢養家"},{"w":"go to waste","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to be thrown away or not used","cn":"被浪費","s":"We packed the leftovers in boxes because we did not want the food to ______ ______ ______, and we ate it the next day.","zh":"我們把剩菜裝進盒子裡，因為不想讓食物被浪費，而且我們隔天就把它吃掉了。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P4","t":"被浪費"},{"w":"make hay while the sun shines","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to make the most of a good chance while it lasts","cn":"趁機行事；把握良機","s":"Mango prices are high this week, so the farmers are picking as fast as they can to ______ ______ ______ ______ ______ ______.","zh":"這週芒果價格很高，所以農民們盡可能快速採收，好把握良機。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P5","t":"把握良機"},{"w":"reap what you sow","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to experience the results of your own actions","cn":"自食其果；種瓜得瓜","s":"He never studied during the term, so he ______ ______ ______ ______ when he failed the final exam.","zh":"他整學期都沒讀書，所以期末考不及格時，他就自食其果了。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P6","t":"自食其果"},{"w":"the cream of the crop","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the best people or things in a group","cn":"精英；佼佼者","s":"Only ______ ______ ______ ______ ______ are chosen for the national cooking team, and they train for hours every day.","zh":"只有佼佼者才會被選入國家烹飪隊，而且他們每天都要訓練好幾個小時。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P7","t":"佼佼者"},{"w":"in season","pos":"adj.phr.","def":"(of fruit or vegetables) available and at their best now","cn":"當季的","s":"Lychees are only ______ ______ for a few weeks in summer, so people buy boxes of them and send them to relatives.","zh":"荔枝只在夏天的幾個星期是當季的，所以人們會一箱箱地買來寄給親戚。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P8","t":"當季的"},{"w":"out of season","pos":"adj.phr.","def":"(of fruit or vegetables) not naturally available at this time","cn":"非當季的","s":"Strawberries are expensive when they are ______ ______ ______, because they have to be flown in from other countries.","zh":"草莓在非當季時很貴，因為它們必須從其他國家空運進口。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P9","t":"非當季"},{"w":"a bad apple","pos":"n.phr.","def":"one bad person who has a bad effect on others","cn":"害群之馬","s":"Most food sellers at the market are honest, but ______ ______ ______ who sold fake honey has hurt everyone's reputation.","zh":"市場裡大部分的攤販都很誠實，但一個賣假蜂蜜的害群之馬損害了大家的名聲。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P10","t":"害群之馬"},{"w":"bear fruit","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to produce good results","cn":"開花結果；產生成果","s":"The farmer's years of hard work finally ______ ______, and his organic rice is now sold in top restaurants.","zh":"這位農夫多年的努力終於開花結果，而他的有機米現在在頂級餐廳販售。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P11","t":"開花結果"},{"w":"cut back on","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to reduce the amount of something you use or eat","cn":"減少（使用量）","s":"My doctor told me to ______ ______ ______ salty snacks, so I now eat fruit when I feel hungry after school.","zh":"醫生叫我減少吃鹹的零食，所以現在我放學後肚子餓時改吃水果。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P12","t":"減少"},{"w":"eat out","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to have a meal in a restaurant rather than at home","cn":"外食；上館子","s":"Many people in Taipei ______ ______ almost every day because they work long hours, but cooking at home is usually healthier.","zh":"許多台北人幾乎每天都外食，因為他們工時很長，但在家做飯通常比較健康。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P13","t":"外食"},{"w":"food for thought","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an idea that makes you think seriously","cn":"值得深思的事","s":"The film about food waste gave us ______ ______ ______, and our class decided to start a leftovers campaign.","zh":"那部關於食物浪費的電影給了我們值得深思的事，而我們班決定發起一項剩菜再利用活動。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P14","t":"值得深思的事"},{"w":"have a sweet tooth","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to like eating sweet food very much","cn":"愛吃甜食","s":"My little sister ______ ______ ______ ______, so my mother hides the chocolate on the top shelf.","zh":"我妹妹很愛吃甜食，所以我媽媽把巧克力藏在最上層的架子上。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P15","t":"很愛吃甜食"},{"w":"a piece of cake","pos":"n.phr.","def":"something very easy to do","cn":"小事一樁；易如反掌","s":"Making dumplings looked difficult at first, but after my grandmother showed me, it was ______ ______ ______ ______.","zh":"包水餃一開始看起來很難，但奶奶示範給我看之後，就變得易如反掌了。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P16","t":"易如反掌"},{"w":"cry over spilt milk","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to be upset about something that cannot be changed","cn":"為無法挽回的事懊悔","s":"The typhoon destroyed half the crop, but there is no point in ______ ______ ______ ______, so the farmers started replanting.","zh":"颱風摧毀了一半的作物，但為無法挽回的事懊悔也沒有用，所以農民們開始重新種植。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P17","t":"為無法挽回的事懊悔"},{"w":"sell like hot cakes","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to sell very quickly and in large numbers","cn":"大賣；搶手","s":"The new pineapple cakes ______ ______ ______ ______ at the festival, and the bakery ran out before noon.","zh":"新推出的鳳梨酥在節慶上大賣，而這家麵包店中午不到就賣光了。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P18","t":"大賣"},{"w":"put all one's eggs in one basket","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to depend on only one plan or thing","cn":"孤注一擲","s":"Farmers who grow only bananas ______ ______ ______ ______ ______ ______ ______, so one disease could ruin them.","zh":"只種香蕉的農民等於孤注一擲，所以一種病害就可能讓他們破產。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P19","t":"孤注一擲"},{"w":"bread and butter","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the main way someone earns money","cn":"主要收入來源；生計","s":"Rice is the ______ ______ ______ of this village, but young farmers are also trying coffee and tea to earn more.","zh":"稻米是這個村莊的主要收入來源，但年輕農民也在嘗試種咖啡和茶來賺更多錢。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P20","t":"主要收入來源"}]};
